WEBVTT

00:00:49.072 --> 00:00:50.372
Come on, bro!

00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:54.531
Woo!

00:00:54.722 --> 00:00:55.722
Woo woo woo!

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.340
- Whoa, whoa.
Hey, watch it!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:18.540
- You're in my way, bro.
- Oh, okay!

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.760
- That all you got?
- You want to go faster, huh?

00:01:45.684 --> 00:01:46.784
Woo!

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:56.428
This is cool, bro.

00:01:56.552 --> 00:01:58.746
Skxawng.
Let go

00:02:01.362 --> 00:02:02.980
It's cool riding with you, bro.

00:02:03.004 --> 00:02:04.010
High four!

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.688
All right. I gotta get back, bro.

00:02:14.712 --> 00:02:16.090
Little brother,

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.190
Tell me one thing before you go.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.210
How did I die?

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:30.288
You got shot.

00:02:31.912 --> 00:02:34.563
We could have escaped.
But I made us go back for Spider.

00:02:34.887 --> 00:02:36.820
Then we had to go back.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:39.605
That's not your fault.
- Tell that to Dad.

00:02:40.029 --> 00:02:42.480
We weren't even supposed to be out there.

00:02:43.804 --> 00:02:47.063
I got us caught because
I disobeyed orders.

00:02:47.087 --> 00:02:48.440
That's just you. Little bro.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.810
- I love you, brother.
- Skxawng.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.105
I killed my brother.

00:03:10.329 --> 00:03:11.690
No matter what happens,

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.330
I have to live with that
for the rest of my life.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.589
- I wish I could do it.
- I wish I could do it!

00:03:59.189 --> 00:04:02.750
If I have another stupid seizure underwater.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.090
Yeah. You'd be me without a mask.

00:04:05.651 --> 00:04:07.831
(Choking sounds)

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:10.313
Let's test that.
See what happens.

00:04:10.337 --> 00:04:12.313
Hey, watch the stitches.
Watch the stitches!

00:04:13.437 --> 00:04:15.900
How do you like that, huh?

00:04:20.904 --> 00:04:26.404
♪ Lie si oe Neteyamur ♪

00:04:27.461 --> 00:04:33.294
♪ Nawma sa'nokur mìfa oeyä ♪

00:04:34.193 --> 00:04:38.773
♪ Atanti ngal molunge ♪

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:41.900
♪ Atanti ngal molunge ♪
- The fire of hate leaves only the ash of grief.

00:04:42.197 --> 00:04:44.036
♪ Mipa tìreyti, mipa 'itanti ♪

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.038
♪ Mipa tìreyti, mipa 'itanti ♪
- My mother mourned the ancient way,

00:04:46.962 --> 00:04:49.420
♪ Mipa tìreyti, mipa 'itanti ♪
- singing her son's life during the daily eclipse.

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.520
♪ Lawnol a mì te'lan ♪

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.340
♪ Lawnol a mì te'lan ♪
- Because the light always returns.

00:04:55.655 --> 00:05:00.535
♪ Lawnol a mì te'lan ♪

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.063
There's the Na' Vi way.

00:05:04.487 --> 00:05:09.850
And then there's my Dad's way.
Say nothing. Keep busy.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.030
The reef people say,
the sea washes you clean.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:33.430
Washes away your sins.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:14.063
What do you got?

00:06:14.087 --> 00:06:16.480
You're supposed to be collecting guns,
that thing's useless.

00:06:17.104 --> 00:06:18.600
Focus, boy.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:25.150
Don't let your mother see that.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.610
Excuse me. Tuk...

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:49.140
- Bro,
- Oh sick.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:52.000
What is this?

00:06:52.924 --> 00:06:54.230
Tsireya,

00:06:55.254 --> 00:06:56.720
What are you doing?

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:02.340
- This is an AR, right?
This is the mag.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.688
That's where the bullets are ... empty.

00:07:05.912 --> 00:07:10.900
Slap it, rack it and then boom!
You can just spray.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.721
You can kill a lot of sky people with this.

00:07:13.745 --> 00:07:16.130
- See? Ceramic action.
You clean them and oil them

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.063
Be as good as new.

00:07:18.087 --> 00:07:21.355
This is not the Na' vi way. Jake Sully.

00:07:21.379 --> 00:07:23.150
Weapons of metal are forbidden.

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:26.510
You know this.
To touch them poisons the heart.

00:07:27.869 --> 00:07:29.390
Eywa will provide.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:32.071
Right.

00:07:33.195 --> 00:07:35.396
The mourning period is not even over.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.822
- Tuk.
- You should be with your family.

00:07:37.845 --> 00:07:42.310
Not gathering these things.
Your woman needs you.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:47.750
My son lies with the ancestors in the reef.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.390
This is our home.
I said I would stand and fight.

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:54.021
But I can't fight gunships with spears.

00:07:54.345 --> 00:07:55.810
We sank the demon ship.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:58.750
The pink skins fear us now.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.390
Yeah, we got lucky.
And they got many more ships.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.605
Least we got these.

00:08:06.329 --> 00:08:09.060
We are grateful you stand with us,
Jake Sully

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.188
It is not guns we need.

00:08:11.212 --> 00:08:13.230
It is rider of Last shadow.

00:08:13.854 --> 00:08:18.500
Ride Great Toruk, as you did before.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:24.640
When you ride the beast,
you become the beast.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.520
And the more blood, the better.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:32.990
I will not become Toruk Makto again.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:38.771
Jake Sully. You are always Toruk Makto.

00:08:38.795 --> 00:08:41.670
Come. Rotxo.

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.696
Can you hear me?

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.250
Yeah, we can hear you.
Loud and clear. Go on, Doc.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:55.646
So uh, we've been through the wreck,
inside and out.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:58.880
And we searched through about
200 meter radius around it.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.600
We didn't find any Na'vi bodies,
just crew.

00:09:01.864 --> 00:09:03.844
Or.. what's left of it

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.920
- Well, keep looking, Doctor.
Expand the search radius.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:12.000
- Roger that. I would note though,
I did find an interesting new algae.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.271
Sullys still out there.

00:09:16.295 --> 00:09:17.438
We don't know that.

00:09:17.462 --> 00:09:19.260
Scavengers could have
carried off the bodies.

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:23.660
Nope. He made it out.
And he's in this area,

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:27.060
down to a handful of villages.
You just give me a ship and I'll...

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.155
- I gave you a ship.

00:09:28.179 --> 00:09:29.471
It's right there on the bottom.

00:09:29.495 --> 00:09:33.580
- Yeah, along with my crew.
All dead.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:40.455
You brought me out here 26 trillion miles
for a single mission.

00:09:40.579 --> 00:09:46.540
A kinetic hard kill op against one guy.
I ain't backing off!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.730
Hello? Do they have me on here?

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:04.530
The spirit of my ancestors is in this bow.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.890
It was our strength.

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.190
I can help you fix it, Lo'ak.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.300
No! It's ruined!

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.820
Everything I touch gets ruined.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.188
They never talked about it,

00:10:29.712 --> 00:10:31.563
but it was there in the room.

00:10:32.487 --> 00:10:34.320
Like a crouching Thanator...

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.050
I know you will never give up your bow.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.050
So...

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:49.350
Just don't be close when it hits.

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:10.700
So you agree with Ronal?

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:17.980
I will never speak against my husband
in front of that woman.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.480
Look, I'm a Marine.

00:11:23.504 --> 00:11:28.120
Not taking a knife to a gunfight..
Or a prayer.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.790
So what am I supposed to do?

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:37.910
I can't run. I can't fight.
Oh, that's right.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.321
Eywa will provide. Yeah.

00:11:41.345 --> 00:11:43.588
So where was Eywa?
Where was Eywa when our son..

00:11:43.612 --> 00:11:44.830
- Jake!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.870
I'm in this place where I have nothing.

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:53.790
Not my people, not my forest.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.330
Even my father's bow is gone.

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:03.788
All I have is my faith

00:12:03.912 --> 00:12:07.010
that this is the Great Mother's plan.

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.550
You have this family.

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.280
And you have me.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.080
And I love you so much.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.900
Yeah, Payakan!
You're the man!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:25.880
Yo! Yo!

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.700
This is sick.

00:13:37.126 --> 00:13:38.726
Wooo!

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.660
Go for it! Go go go go!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.260
That was insane, Cuz.
- I know, right bro

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.500
I thought you were dead

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:07.188
It sucks that Payakan is still an outcast.

00:14:07.212 --> 00:14:09.771
Yeah, after saving
all our asses.

00:14:09.795 --> 00:14:13.500
No. I'm sorry. But by the
tulkun way he bears the deaths.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:18.070
All those who died in the battle,
he bears those deaths.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:23.030
I'm sorry. You saved us all.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.990
Forever, brother. Always.

00:14:40.269 --> 00:14:42.869
(Faint beeping)

00:14:42.922 --> 00:14:44.362
(Gasping for air)

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.020
Dad!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.621
- Wait. Where's the spare?
- It's in the basket I think..

00:14:52.545 --> 00:14:55.646
Get up. Wake up. Where's - hey!
Where's the spare mask?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:56.670
- What?
- Where's the spare mask?

00:14:56.671 --> 00:14:57.671
It used to be there.
Where is it?

00:14:57.729 --> 00:14:58.729
- I don't know.
- Find it.

00:14:58.770 --> 00:14:59.813
It's not here.

00:14:59.837 --> 00:15:01.596
- Speak to me. Where is it?
- I can't find it.

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:02.771
Hurry. Hurry. Where is it?

00:15:02.795 --> 00:15:04.075
- Come on. Come on. Come on.
- I got it.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.521
- Dad. Dad!
- Hurry.

00:15:05.545 --> 00:15:06.560
I found it.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:17.940
Breathe. Breathe.
Breathe deep and slow.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.700
Deep and slow.
There you go, you're okay.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.820
I'm good. I'm good. I'm okay.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.271
Skxawng. You have to be careful.

00:15:29.295 --> 00:15:30.946
Careful's my middle name.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.955
Yeah, skxawng.
You should be more careful, little baby.

00:15:32.879 --> 00:15:34.700
- Pay attention.
- Get off. Get off.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.290
- You have to pay attention.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.050
- The wind traders.
The wind traders are here.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:50.855
The wind traders are coming.
Come on.

00:15:51.079 --> 00:15:52.210
Come on. Let's go.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.530
Come on. Come on.

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.470
Hey,

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:36.850
Hey

00:16:38.534 --> 00:16:39.534
- Oh!

00:16:40.246 --> 00:16:41.746
Look!

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:45.480
- Look at him.
It's not going to take up much room.

00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:48.440
As long as he's no trouble.

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.105
Take a knee. Let's go.
Tuk, Come on.

00:16:51.129 --> 00:16:52.855
Kiri.
Kiri, please.

00:16:52.879 --> 00:16:54.400
- Children. Please sit down

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.050
Your mother and I have come to a decision,

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.438
Spider. You're gonna live
back in high camp with Norm.

00:17:06.462 --> 00:17:07.610
- What?
- The Wind Traders will take you.

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.370
No, dad, you can't.

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:13.630
Spider, you can't live
in a mask day and night.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:15.513
I just want to stay here with you.

00:17:15.537 --> 00:17:18.410
- I know. But it's just too risky.
- This isn't fair.

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:21.521
But please. You're the
only family I've ever known.

00:17:21.545 --> 00:17:22.813
- This is what's best for you.

00:17:22.837 --> 00:17:24.605
But dad, he's our best friend!

00:17:24.629 --> 00:17:27.105
- Can we just find a way?
- It's too dangerous.

00:17:27.129 --> 00:17:29.355
You're one dead battery away
from being dead yourself.

00:17:29.379 --> 00:17:31.146
He belongs with his own kind,

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:35.521
- Mom.
- And what kind is that, Mother?

00:17:35.545 --> 00:17:36.771
- Alien?
- Kiri

00:17:36.795 --> 00:17:38.388
- Pink ass?
- Stop.

00:17:38.512 --> 00:17:40.620
You hate them so much.
That's all you see.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:42.955
It's Spider.

00:17:43.379 --> 00:17:46.313
Please, Jake, Mr. Sully.
I won't be any problem.

00:17:46.337 --> 00:17:47.355
You know that.

00:17:47.379 --> 00:17:48.410
Dad, this isn't right.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:50.480
Spider is part of this family.

00:17:50.504 --> 00:17:53.688
He will never be
a part of this family.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:59.521
The caravan is the safest way to move him.

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:00.850
- No. Please.
- He's going today.

00:18:00.874 --> 00:18:02.646
- You can't do this
- Alright, it's a done deal!

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:05.896
Enough, it's not - this is a family.
It's not a democracy.

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.638
- Alright.
- I hate you!

00:18:08.762 --> 00:18:10.280
- This is what is best, baby girl.
- No!

00:18:10.404 --> 00:18:12.450
- Hey, it's okay.
- Don't touch me.

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:16.660
Hey. It's okay.
You understand?

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.020
- No.
- I already lost my brother.

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.340
I can't lose anyone else.

00:18:24.206 --> 00:18:25.306
(Hissing)

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.420
Sullys stick together.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:35.480
Yep. That's the family motto.

00:18:38.704 --> 00:18:40.280
- This is bullshit
- This isn't fair.

00:18:40.304 --> 00:18:42.950
Okay. Okay. Hey. All right,

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:45.870
How about this?
We all go together to drop him off.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:50.438
Kiri, you said you wanted
to see your grandmother.

00:18:50.762 --> 00:18:53.850
Yeah. It will be an adventure
for the whole family

00:18:58.830 --> 00:18:59.990
Yeah. Cool.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.610
- Hey. Stay here.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:20.250
Our arrangement was for
the pink skin boy only.

00:19:20.649 --> 00:19:23.610
- We won't be any trouble.
- You are already trouble.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:26.770
A trader must move freely.
We cannot choose sides.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:32.396
Having Toruk Makto on board cuts really close
to choosing a side in this war.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.890
Maybe you're mistaken.

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:37.090
Toruk Makto was never on your ship.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:44.310
But if he was ever aboard,
then him and his woman

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:47.570
would be happy to fly as outriders
and protect your caravan.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.188
Perhaps so,

00:19:52.212 --> 00:19:57.900
the Mangkwan raiders grow more aggressive.
Very well.

00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.580
I'm with you on this.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.860
- Cast off!
- Come on.

00:20:13.018 --> 00:20:14.678
- Cast off below!

00:20:19.905 --> 00:20:20.905
Lo'ak!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.430
- Lo'ak!
- Tsireya! Tsireya!

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:28.190
Ready our bow!

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:33.030
Haul all lines. Come to starboard.

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:46.310
Windward. Main shaft pull.
Pull out and race. Pull to windward

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.460
Lighten ship. Come up easy.

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:07.420
Windward and pull.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.220
Woo, yeah!

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:05.460
- Everyone mourns in their own way.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:12.530
For me, it's being up here alone.

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:16.850
I feel him with me.

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:23.510
- Bro. Check it out.
- I hear his voice in the wind..

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:41.300
Hold this.

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:51.805
Hey dad, I've been thinking.

00:22:52.329 --> 00:22:55.063
I should carry a rifle and
I can fly with you.

00:22:56.987 --> 00:22:58.810
That's gonna happen..

00:22:58.870 --> 00:23:01.313
Why not? You trained me to shoot,

00:23:01.337 --> 00:23:02.630
Okay, I know what I'm doing.

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:06.521
Where's your comms?
I called you like five times.

00:23:08.345 --> 00:23:09.930
Where are your comms?

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:14.570
There's rule number one.
You can't even do that

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:32.040
That's it.

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:35.355
What you got?

00:23:35.379 --> 00:23:36.730
So I promise this guy in imaging,

00:23:36.754 --> 00:23:38.730
a case of beer if he
ever got something for us.

00:23:39.654 --> 00:23:42.563
Long range patrols. Talk to these
guys when they punch our airspace.

00:23:42.587 --> 00:23:46.080
Routine fly-by.
Here's the enhanced.

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:54.530
- Smile, bitches.
- When?

00:23:54.890 --> 00:23:57.770
13:50. Today.
I got coordinates.

00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:01.050
- Let's mount up.
- Thank you.

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:17.700
Pull in hard.

00:24:35.620 --> 00:24:38.500
- Your pack?
- I'm good. I got plenty of time.

00:24:50.510 --> 00:24:51.550
Cleared ahead.

00:25:06.876 --> 00:25:09.176
Jake! Mangkwan!

00:25:11.390 --> 00:25:13.430
- Mangkwan Raiders, weapons up.
- Sound me the alarm!

00:25:20.710 --> 00:25:24.630
- Kiri, Go! Run!
- Go. Come on. Let's go.

00:25:24.630 --> 00:25:25.710
Let's go, to cover!

00:25:36.570 --> 00:25:37.472
Go, go!

00:25:37.795 --> 00:25:39.271
- Protect your sisters.
Can you do that?

00:25:39.295 --> 00:25:42.130
Yes, sir.
