Tuktirey..

00:59:43.158 --> 00:59:44.158
Kiri..

00:59:50.840 --> 00:59:54.360
Iron Sky Blue on actual.
We are inbound at the city wall.

01:00:06.040 --> 01:00:09.600
So you think he's still with Sully?
- I'd make book on it

01:00:09.900 --> 01:00:11.980
- This is not my priority.

01:00:12.004 --> 01:00:14.188
My priority is getting this city built

01:00:14.212 --> 01:00:16.321
and sending back Amrita to pay for it.

01:00:16.345 --> 01:00:18.480
- And who do you think sets
your priorities, General?

01:00:18.504 --> 01:00:22.000
It's the big picture, guys.
So here's a big picture concept for you.

01:00:22.000 --> 01:00:23.855
How are we supposed to colonize this world

01:00:23.879 --> 01:00:25.147
if we can't breathe the freaking air?

01:00:25.170 --> 01:00:28.380
- You want to find the boy,
you gotta find Sully.

01:00:28.880 --> 01:00:32.020
- And there...
- Ow! How many more of these, huh?

01:00:32.520 --> 01:00:34.771
- Not many more.
- That's what you said yesterday.

01:00:34.795 --> 01:00:36.896
Here's the most recent scan.

01:00:36.920 --> 01:00:39.550
Now, you see this? This is all mycelium.

01:00:39.550 --> 01:00:42.271
It's basically the same
thing as the forest network.

01:00:42.295 --> 01:00:46.230
Somehow it colonized him,
spread through his entire system,

01:00:46.254 --> 01:00:48.646
and then made changes
at the cellular level.

01:00:48.670 --> 01:00:53.271
I mean, look, it altered his blood
chemistry, his nervous system, his lungs.

01:00:53.295 --> 01:00:57.480
- Can you get it out?
- No. It's an endosymbiont.

01:00:57.504 --> 01:00:59.230
- We think they're keeping each other alive.

01:01:00.110 --> 01:01:01.855
It could kill him if we even try.

01:01:01.879 --> 01:01:05.771
- But look, I mean, he's.
He's alive, he's healthy.

01:01:05.795 --> 01:01:09.480
- Maybe this is a good thing.
- A good thing?

01:01:13.720 --> 01:01:16.520
What if the RDA labs
could reverse engineer this?

01:01:16.920 --> 01:01:20.040
What if every human being on Earth
could live here without a mask?

01:01:23.080 --> 01:01:26.680
Ah. Jake, there's something else. Sit.

01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:30.130
Hey, buddy. Okay, okay.
- Hey!

01:01:30.770 --> 01:01:32.930
- Hold. Hold still. Hold still. You're fine.

01:01:34.210 --> 01:01:36.430
- Ow.
- Look at that

01:01:36.820 --> 01:01:38.026
- What are you doing?

01:01:38.050 --> 01:01:40.530
- What is that?
- He's growing a kuru.

01:01:41.570 --> 01:01:43.290
- Wait, what?
- Oh, yeah

01:01:59.190 --> 01:02:02.390
Great Mother, are you there?

01:02:03.750 --> 01:02:06.550
Please hear my small voice.

01:02:09.110 --> 01:02:12.950
I prayed to you in the forest
to save my friend.

01:02:14.070 --> 01:02:15.430
I prayed so hard.

01:02:18.550 --> 01:02:22.560
But you didn't come.
You didn't answer.

01:02:23.040 --> 01:02:25.280
So I had to do it myself.

01:02:26.480 --> 01:02:30.560
I don't know how. I...
I asked the roots to help me.

01:02:31.520 --> 01:02:33.040
I don't remember how..

01:02:36.159 --> 01:02:39.200
Please, no. No.
Don't shut me out.

01:02:40.020 --> 01:02:41.413
Why am I like this?

01:02:42.537 --> 01:02:44.863
How am I doing these things?

01:02:45.187 --> 01:02:47.590
Please, just. Just talk to me.

01:02:48.030 --> 01:02:51.470
Please. No. No. Please.

01:02:51.630 --> 01:02:54.430
Please. No. No.

01:03:11.640 --> 01:03:14.146
You want that one? All
right, let's take these off.

01:03:14.170 --> 01:03:15.355
- Kiri...
- Run some more tests.

01:03:15.379 --> 01:03:18.440
Eywa never came to me.
I told you,

01:03:19.000 --> 01:03:21.800
I don't know how I did it.
- Drink.

01:03:22.520 --> 01:03:25.521
Kiri. My child.

01:03:25.545 --> 01:03:27.771
You are touched
by the Old Mother's hand.

01:03:28.295 --> 01:03:30.240
This we have known

01:03:30.520 --> 01:03:31.640
since you were born.

01:03:40.450 --> 01:03:42.021
There's something you're hiding.

01:03:42.045 --> 01:03:45.271
I have felt it my whole life.

01:03:45.295 --> 01:03:47.090
Just tell me the truth.

01:03:48.290 --> 01:03:51.490
Please..
- Tell her.

01:03:54.450 --> 01:03:55.510
It is time.

01:03:58.050 --> 01:04:01.910
- My child. You do not..

01:04:02.210 --> 01:04:05.240
have a father, Kiri.

01:04:05.980 --> 01:04:07.646
- What?
- You.

01:04:07.670 --> 01:04:09.180
You-Your mother.

01:04:09.420 --> 01:04:12.700
Okay. Gracie's avatar.
And when she was pregnant,

01:04:12.780 --> 01:04:15.771
Norm ran some tests
and it was a path- patholo-...

01:04:15.795 --> 01:04:20.380
- A parthenogenic birth. You're
genetically identical to the avatar.

01:04:20.620 --> 01:04:22.780
There literally is no father.

01:04:24.460 --> 01:04:27.420
- I'm a clone?
- Granddaughter.

01:04:28.310 --> 01:04:30.710
It was the will of Eywa.

01:04:32.390 --> 01:04:36.110
When the dreamwalker body lay here in the

01:04:36.610 --> 01:04:37.670
Great Mother's hands,

01:04:40.150 --> 01:04:41.990
a seed was planted.

01:04:55.120 --> 01:05:00.063
That really sucks.
That makes me even more of a freak.

01:05:00.087 --> 01:05:01.680
- No. Granddaughter.

01:05:02.640 --> 01:05:05.280
You are Eywa's child.

01:05:11.840 --> 01:05:13.520
I don't care how it happened.

01:05:15.040 --> 01:05:19.520
You're my baby girl,
and I'm the only father you'll ever need.

01:05:25.120 --> 01:05:26.320
- If I am so special,

01:05:28.320 --> 01:05:30.720
Why does Eywa fold her ears to me?

01:05:33.760 --> 01:05:36.813
Look, we don't know why,
but you're locked out from her.

01:05:36.837 --> 01:05:39.480
- It's some kind of firewall.
- Yeah, it's like an encryption.

01:05:39.504 --> 01:05:44.146
The harder you try to break in,
the harder it fights back.

01:05:44.170 --> 01:05:45.720
- Eywa has a path for you.

01:05:45.870 --> 01:05:50.271
Though she chooses to conceal it,
you must trust in her.

01:05:50.495 --> 01:05:53.830
- I have to find out what it is.
- No. You have to

01:05:54.130 --> 01:05:56.990
stop asking. Kiri, if..

01:05:58.030 --> 01:06:00.910
If- If you try to connect again,
you could die.

01:06:01.629 --> 01:06:03.950
You do it underwater and you will die.

01:06:08.990 --> 01:06:11.940
- He can't stay here. If the RDA get him.

01:06:13.290 --> 01:06:16.146
We will never stop 'em..

01:06:16.170 --> 01:06:19.813
If he is so dangerous to
the people, to everything.

01:06:19.837 --> 01:06:22.010
We should just kill him.

01:06:27.370 --> 01:06:30.370
It's Spider. He'll come with us.

01:06:30.870 --> 01:06:33.610
He'll come to the reef.
We can protect him there.

01:06:35.620 --> 01:06:37.938
Toruk Makto knows best.

01:06:37.962 --> 01:06:41.563
Come on, baby. It's not like that.

01:06:41.587 --> 01:06:43.300
- It is decided.

01:06:54.960 --> 01:06:56.960
30 Meters! Get me up in there.

01:07:03.950 --> 01:07:05.105
Get me in the pocket.

01:07:05.129 --> 01:07:09.550
Get me in the pocket with the rocket.
Ten meters.

01:07:12.110 --> 01:07:13.790
Here we go. And...

01:07:29.660 --> 01:07:31.820
Lung shot. She's bleeding out.

01:08:07.350 --> 01:08:10.950
A new demonship has come, bigger.

01:08:11.589 --> 01:08:14.950
More of our Tulkun have been killed.
- I'm so sorry, brother.

01:08:15.510 --> 01:08:19.230
- Jake Sully, the outcast is
stirring up the young bulls.

01:08:19.254 --> 01:08:22.500
Our Tulkun have called for
council to decide about him.

01:08:24.660 --> 01:08:27.396
You must rest.

01:08:27.420 --> 01:08:29.855
- This must be removed.
See me

01:08:29.879 --> 01:08:31.620
- Kids. Kids on me.

01:08:42.660 --> 01:08:44.563
No, I'm serious. When it grows long enough,

01:08:44.587 --> 01:08:45.855
I'm gonna get my own ilu.

01:08:45.879 --> 01:08:49.105
You skxawng!
You need a very small ilu.

01:08:49.129 --> 01:08:51.271
Just you watch. I'm gonna
get my own Skimwing.

01:08:51.295 --> 01:08:53.379
- Oh, Skimwing.
- Then I'll be the one laughing.

01:08:54.099 --> 01:08:57.219
So how is this? Your daughter?

01:08:57.699 --> 01:09:02.188
Your half-blood daughter .. with no training.

01:09:02.812 --> 01:09:07.605
Hold here.
Has done what no Tsahìk could do.

01:09:08.329 --> 01:09:11.271
- Who are you to question
the will of Eywa?

01:09:11.295 --> 01:09:14.669
- I am Tsahìk.
- Then be Tsahìk.

01:09:14.769 --> 01:09:19.188
These herbs do nothing.
Herbs from my forest heal faster.

01:09:20.412 --> 01:09:23.646
- I tell you to rest.
You do not rest.

01:09:23.670 --> 01:09:25.729
Then you blame my herbs.

01:09:27.329 --> 01:09:28.329
Hold still,

01:09:31.049 --> 01:09:32.113
Stupid woman.

01:09:32.337 --> 01:09:36.529
Careful, Tsahìk,
or I may forget that you are with child.

01:09:37.243 --> 01:09:39.643
(HISSING ANGRILY)

01:09:57.779 --> 01:09:59.096
The matriarch has spoken.

01:09:59.420 --> 01:10:04.159
She says the outcast continues
to defy the Tulkun way.

01:10:04.879 --> 01:10:06.313
All killing is forbidden.

01:10:06.337 --> 01:10:10.771
He was outcast for this,
but he has done it again.

01:10:10.772 --> 01:10:15.607
The outcast attacked the
demon ship, bringing death to our people.

01:10:17.450 --> 01:10:19.690
Even the son of Toruk Makto.

01:10:20.366 --> 01:10:21.366
- Dad..

01:10:21.390 --> 01:10:24.130
They can't blame Payakan for that.
- Not now.

01:10:30.270 --> 01:10:32.680
She says he continues to disrupt,

01:10:33.960 --> 01:10:36.440
spreading bad ideas among our young.

01:10:39.000 --> 01:10:42.980
- It's bullshit.
- It's not true.
She says he will only bring more death.

01:10:43.004 --> 01:10:45.880
- Hey, why don't you say something?

01:10:46.599 --> 01:10:48.380
Just say something, please.

01:10:54.200 --> 01:10:58.480
She says the outcast
may not stay in these waters.
- No..

01:10:58.504 --> 01:11:04.210
He must go far where his song
cannot be heard. Exile for life.

01:11:06.850 --> 01:11:07.930
- It's not fair.

01:11:10.610 --> 01:11:11.670
It is decided.

01:11:17.330 --> 01:11:21.090
- No, no! Payakan.
Brother!

01:11:21.730 --> 01:11:24.890
Please, no. Payakan. Brother!

01:11:32.410 --> 01:11:35.130
This is- This is wrong.
This is wrong.

01:11:36.410 --> 01:11:40.010
- You do not speak here.
- No. Payakan fought for us.

01:11:40.210 --> 01:11:41.221
He fought for us.

01:11:41.245 --> 01:11:42.490
He saved your daughter's life.

01:11:42.539 --> 01:11:45.246
He saved her life!
- This is council, you do not speak!

01:11:45.287 --> 01:11:47.170
- He defended us.
- This is counsel.

01:11:47.560 --> 01:11:48.605
- The elders have spoken.

01:11:48.629 --> 01:11:51.160
The Tulkun are being hunted.
They are dying.

01:11:51.860 --> 01:11:53.021
- Lo'ak, that's enough.

01:11:53.045 --> 01:11:55.496
- No!
- Lo'ak, speak the truth!

01:11:55.497 --> 01:11:56.571
- No, Tsireya.
- No!

01:11:56.495 --> 01:11:58.460
- Daughter.
- Payakan is a warrior.

01:11:58.820 --> 01:12:01.780
He fought for us more than you.
Or you.

01:12:02.420 --> 01:12:03.730
More than any of you.

01:12:03.754 --> 01:12:05.280
- He fought for us.
- Sit down.

01:12:05.320 --> 01:12:06.320
- Lo'ak...

01:12:06.420 --> 01:12:08.896
- Take him from here!
- Come on. Make a hole.

01:12:08.920 --> 01:12:11.620
- Dad, listen to him.
- We are in council.

01:12:12.308 --> 01:12:13.988
The elders have spoken.

01:12:14.270 --> 01:12:15.310
- What are you doing?

01:12:17.150 --> 01:12:18.563
- You never stand up for me.

01:12:18.587 --> 01:12:19.710
- Be seated.

01:12:19.818 --> 01:12:20.818
- Come on..

01:12:22.430 --> 01:12:23.790
- Council continues.

01:12:26.590 --> 01:12:28.855
We're at war.
You understand that?

01:12:28.879 --> 01:12:32.430
If you disobey orders, people get killed.

01:12:33.870 --> 01:12:36.396
With Spider here, we're
trying to keep a low profile.

01:12:36.420 --> 01:12:39.021
But that rogue is out there.
He's stirring up the young bulls.

01:12:39.045 --> 01:12:41.313
He was gonna bring
the whole RDA down on us.

01:12:41.337 --> 01:12:45.355
- You want him gone? That's
why you didn't say anything.

01:12:45.379 --> 01:12:48.188
- He's a loose cannon. He's just like you.

01:12:48.212 --> 01:12:50.471
In fact, if you hadn't gone
to him in the first place,

01:12:50.495 --> 01:12:51.563
if you hadn't disobeyed orders

01:12:51.587 --> 01:12:53.020
then your brother would still be...

01:13:00.060 --> 01:13:02.700
- That wasn't my fault... Dad, that..

01:13:05.050 --> 01:13:06.190
That's not my fault!

01:13:10.930 --> 01:13:11.970
Lo'ak.

01:13:29.070 --> 01:13:30.570
Go to him, Jake.

01:13:34.750 --> 01:13:36.350
Or you will lose another son.

01:13:40.130 --> 01:13:41.890
- I got nothing to say to him.

01:13:44.430 --> 01:13:45.830
Do not blame Lo'ak.

01:13:49.110 --> 01:13:51.188
You said you could protect this family.

01:13:51.212 --> 01:13:52.470
That you could do.

01:13:53.830 --> 01:13:55.480
- Yeah. I thought we would be safe here.

01:13:55.504 --> 01:13:57.938
- Our son is dead, Jake.

01:13:58.062 --> 01:13:59.860
- I was wrong.

01:14:01.880 --> 01:14:03.146
What do you want me to say?

01:14:03.150 --> 01:14:05.568
That every decision
that I made for this family is wrong?

01:14:06.112 --> 01:14:08.120
I killed our son?

01:14:13.360 --> 01:14:15.520
- And still we are here in this place,

01:14:16.640 --> 01:14:20.400
Hiding this pink skin.
This alien.

01:14:21.280 --> 01:14:24.670
If I had to choose between
my family and a pink skin,

01:14:25.130 --> 01:14:28.921
I would kill him right now.
- Stop, stop. Stop.

01:14:29.045 --> 01:14:31.390
We're not doing this.
We're not doing this.

01:14:32.510 --> 01:14:35.950
You already chose between
your family and a pink skin

01:14:35.951 --> 01:14:36.971
Once, remember?

01:14:41.630 --> 01:14:45.630
You cannot live like this, baby.
In "hate".

01:14:47.560 --> 01:14:50.360
- I hate them, Jake.
I hate them.

01:14:51.960 --> 01:14:55.000
I hate them.
I hate their pink little hands.

01:14:56.440 --> 01:14:59.080
I hate the insanity in their minds,

01:15:02.200 --> 01:15:04.848
- I'm human, inside.

01:15:05.472 --> 01:15:07.663
You hate me?

01:15:08.887 --> 01:15:11.005
I'll always be an alien to you, won't I?

01:15:11.929 --> 01:15:14.390
Doesn't matter how
long I live in this skin.

01:15:16.060 --> 01:15:20.896
Do you hate your children
with their alien hands?

01:15:20.920 --> 01:15:23.180
- No.

01:15:24.540 --> 01:15:27.980
- Are you ashamed every time
they make a mistake,

01:15:27.980 --> 01:15:30.971
every time they're different,

01:15:31.095 --> 01:15:33.500
that's because of
the human inside them, right?

01:15:36.280 --> 01:15:37.340
- Yes.

01:15:56.230 --> 01:15:58.710
Sorry, baby. I'm sorry.

01:16:00.150 --> 01:16:01.150
I'm sorry.

01:16:04.470 --> 01:16:07.610
We have to stand strong right now,

01:16:09.210 --> 01:16:10.890
this family is our fortress.

01:16:34.080 --> 01:16:35.920
The people say that when you touch steel,

01:16:37.200 --> 01:16:38.640
its poison seeps into your heart,

01:17:03.962 --> 01:17:04.962
- Lo'ak!

01:17:06.420 --> 01:17:07.700
- Brother.
- Lo'ak!

01:17:13.740 --> 01:17:15.420
- Stay in this life, brother.

01:17:17.900 --> 01:17:21.013
- We need you.
- We love you.

01:17:21.137 --> 01:17:22.730
- You have greatness in you.

01:17:38.250 --> 01:17:41.130
The strength of the ancestors is here.

01:17:45.370 --> 01:17:46.730
A bow can be fixed.

01:18:04.200 --> 01:18:05.700
Good, good.

01:18:14.730 --> 01:18:15.730
Moment of truth.

01:18:28.130 --> 01:18:29.130
Go.

01:18:33.490 --> 01:18:37.330
You feel her?
- Oh, yeah. I got fins.

01:18:38.690 --> 01:18:39.810
Yeah, you. You do.

01:18:40.126 --> 01:18:42.126
(Cheering)

01:18:43.010 --> 01:18:44.870
- Woo!
- Go. Monkey boy.

01:19:03.730 --> 01:19:04.910
You! Face them!

01:19:07.740 --> 01:19:09.980
Stay calm! Stay calm.

01:19:12.500 --> 01:19:16.088
- Spider.
- I think we're wasting our time, Colonel.

01:19:16.212 --> 01:19:20.080
- They don't know anything.
- Oh, they know. They're just not talking.

01:19:22.140 --> 01:19:25.260
We got one more play, but it's radical.

01:20:08.420 --> 01:20:10.180
Hey. You remember me, don't you?

01:20:11.900 --> 01:20:14.900
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Just relax.
- Mine! Get him up.

01:20:15.001 --> 01:20:16.575
- I brought something for your Tsahìk.

01:20:17.500 --> 01:20:19.720
You take me to your Tsahìk.

01:20:20.240 --> 01:20:22.830
- Move!
- Hey, hey! No need to do that.

01:20:23.150 --> 01:20:25.070
- I got my eye on you.
- Keep going.

01:20:42.520 --> 01:20:44.520
- Tsahìk!

01:21:06.720 --> 01:21:08.320
I'll get you as many as you want.

01:21:19.530 --> 01:21:21.850
What is your name, sky man?

01:21:22.610 --> 01:21:26.610
Quaritch.
Colonel Miles Quaritch.

01:21:32.050 --> 01:21:34.105
You touch me with that
thing again, I'll kill you.

01:21:34.129 --> 01:21:36.771
- You will kill no one,

01:21:38.795 --> 01:21:41.660
- Lady. I'm gonna beg to differ.

01:21:41.781 --> 01:21:42.781
Drop him.

01:22:07.350 --> 01:22:08.370
Good trick.

01:22:10.230 --> 01:22:14.230
- Quaritch.
- You're next cupcake.

01:22:14.790 --> 01:22:16.870
So think careful about what you want to do.

01:22:20.130 --> 01:22:23.970
Come. We will talk inside.

01:22:30.820 --> 01:22:31.940
What are you doing, boss?

01:22:49.840 --> 01:22:50.840
Cozy.

01:22:53.680 --> 01:22:58.730
The thing is,
everybody's lying to me.

01:23:05.770 --> 01:23:11.021
They say that you can make stone
speak the truth.

01:23:11.045 --> 01:23:14.896
- You seek a man.
The other sky man like you?

01:23:15.820 --> 01:23:17.790
- Not like me.

01:23:18.410 --> 01:23:20.021
No, he's a traitor.

01:23:21.045 --> 01:23:23.021
- Then he must die.

01:23:25.045 --> 01:23:27.730
Varang can help you find this man.

01:23:29.054 --> 01:23:32.480
And the other you seek.

01:23:33.204 --> 01:23:35.881
This air breather.

01:23:42.460 --> 01:23:45.020
First, I must see your soul.

01:23:46.370 --> 01:23:47.450
Be still.

01:23:49.090 --> 01:23:50.110
Be still.

01:24:13.640 --> 01:24:15.260
That's some strong shit.

01:24:51.420 --> 01:24:57.340
This... is the only pure thing in this world.

01:25:00.420 --> 01:25:03.630
The fire came from the mountain
when I was little.

01:25:05.670 --> 01:25:07.030
Burnt our forest.

01:25:09.630 --> 01:25:11.550
It took everything.

01:25:15.910 --> 01:25:18.709
My people were starving.

01:25:19.690 --> 01:25:21.530
They cried for help.

01:25:24.650 --> 01:25:27.290
But Eywa did not come.

01:25:29.520 --> 01:25:33.160
So I went to the fire.

01:25:36.200 --> 01:25:38.760
And I learned its way.

01:25:44.000 --> 01:25:47.080
I am the fire.

01:25:49.240 --> 01:25:51.513
By my hand.

01:25:51.837 --> 01:25:53.988
My people grow strong.

01:25:54.212 --> 01:25:57.680
We do not lies down and die

01:25:57.804 --> 01:26:00.730
just because Eywas turns her back on us.

01:26:03.090 --> 01:26:05.890
We turn our back on Eywa.

01:26:07.550 --> 01:26:11.910
A weak mother for weak children.

01:26:14.850 --> 01:26:20.020
We do not suck on
the breast of weakness.

01:26:24.521 --> 01:26:26.021
Now...

01:26:28.140 --> 01:26:33.580
Only true words
will come from your tongue.

01:26:39.260 --> 01:26:42.940
You have a strong heart.
No fear.

01:26:43.584 --> 01:26:44.584
- Ow!

01:26:46.130 --> 01:26:48.850
Ow.. That wasn't cool.

01:26:49.269 --> 01:26:51.602
- I will eat your heart, Quaritch.

01:26:57.610 --> 01:27:00.810
But first you will answer me.

01:27:04.530 --> 01:27:06.130
Why are you here?

01:27:11.580 --> 01:27:12.700
I'm here for you.

01:27:14.500 --> 01:27:17.080
You wish to serve me?

01:27:17.904 --> 01:27:22.700
I don't serve anybody.
I need you.

01:27:24.380 --> 01:27:27.146
Well, I do not need you.

01:27:27.470 --> 01:27:29.855
And I might keep you

01:27:29.879 --> 01:27:34.296
as my slave... to pleasure me.

01:27:34.820 --> 01:27:36.260
That sounds like a fun weekend.

01:27:37.010 --> 01:27:41.405
But that's not what you really want.

01:27:41.529 --> 01:27:42.790
- What do I want?

01:27:45.050 --> 01:27:46.410
- What you've never had.

01:27:49.210 --> 01:27:50.290
An equal.

01:27:54.290 --> 01:27:57.090
You want to spread your fire
across the world?

01:27:58.090 --> 01:28:01.530
Yeah. I'll give you guns.

01:28:02.420 --> 01:28:05.620
I'll give you comms, RPGs.

01:28:06.420 --> 01:28:09.105
Oh, that's strong magic..

01:28:09.429 --> 01:28:13.280
Command from a distance,
strike like lightning.

01:28:14.300 --> 01:28:19.988
The clans, as far as you can fly.

01:28:20.212 --> 01:28:22.020
They'll bow down before Varang.

01:28:28.530 --> 01:28:29.970
You want to take on Eywa?

01:28:32.510 --> 01:28:33.550
You need me.

01:28:39.250 --> 01:28:40.290
I see you,

01:28:42.450 --> 01:28:43.809
Damn right, you do.

01:30:03.369 --> 01:30:06.089
When I can connect again.
Someday.

01:30:07.689 --> 01:30:11.689
Whenever.. I can be your guide
in the spirit world.

01:30:13.459 --> 01:30:15.619
Well, can I just go now?

01:30:16.419 --> 01:30:18.687
- No. Not without me.

01:30:19.511 --> 01:30:22.445
A sky person can't just show up,

01:30:22.469 --> 01:30:24.579
it'd freak out the ancestors.

01:30:35.139 --> 01:30:38.819
They're starting to arrive
for the calf communion.

01:30:41.029 --> 01:30:44.309
Yearling calves and reef babies together.

01:30:45.149 --> 01:30:48.829
Having the first bond with Eywa.
It'll be so beautiful.

01:31:16.508 --> 01:31:17.508
Let me see.

01:31:17.679 --> 01:31:20.239
It's good. I like this on you.

01:31:21.199 --> 01:31:23.199
- Come to the festival.
- No no no no no..

01:31:24.959 --> 01:31:26.999
- Then I will just stay here with you.

01:31:34.949 --> 01:31:40.429
Lo'ak, I should not tell you this,
but my tulkun sister says

01:31:40.453 --> 01:31:43.689
they have been hearing Payakan very faint.

01:31:43.769 --> 01:31:45.845
Calling to his birth clan.
- Where?

01:31:47.269 --> 01:31:50.054
Tulkun song travels very far
through the water, Lo'ak.

01:31:50.278 --> 01:31:51.449
Please,

01:32:21.599 --> 01:32:22.639
Lo'ak.

01:32:26.659 --> 01:32:30.019
- Bye Mom.
- Where are you going?

01:32:32.479 --> 01:32:33.519
Just out.

01:32:35.839 --> 01:32:37.119
There's something I have to do.

01:32:45.769 --> 01:32:46.849
Lo'ak.

01:32:48.969 --> 01:32:53.149
Lo'ak. Lo'ak,
wait!

01:32:55.249 --> 01:32:56.529
Lo'ak.

01:33:12.979 --> 01:33:15.762
We cannot go. The calf
communion is in five days.

01:33:15.786 --> 01:33:18.262
I have to go.
This is my fault.

01:33:18.286 --> 01:33:19.379
We are going.

01:33:20.779 --> 01:33:24.179
All of us.
Get weapons and food.

01:33:24.739 --> 01:33:25.739
Tell no one.

01:33:33.379 --> 01:33:36.909
Our children have gone to look for him.
- You let them?

01:33:37.549 --> 01:33:39.595
They did not ask.

01:33:39.619 --> 01:33:41.529
Alright, we'll get the raiders, we go after them.

01:33:41.529 --> 01:33:43.637
- We cannot search the whole ocean.

01:33:43.661 --> 01:33:45.509
We need the warriors here
for calf communion.

01:33:45.609 --> 01:33:49.389
- If the demon ships come,
- My boy is out there by himself.

01:33:50.909 --> 01:33:53.869
He will come back when he is ready.

01:33:54.909 --> 01:33:56.109
This is his path.

01:34:01.069 --> 01:34:02.189
Look at what he did,

01:34:04.489 --> 01:34:09.279
Jake. The strength of the
ancestors runs in your son's veins.

01:34:09.503 --> 01:34:10.789
You must trust that.

01:34:17.129 --> 01:34:19.609
The way of water has no beginning,

01:34:22.649 --> 01:34:24.809
no end. The sea is your home.

01:34:30.419 --> 01:34:31.499
Before your birth.

01:34:38.259 --> 01:34:39.299
And after your death.

01:35:02.049 --> 01:35:05.569
Where is the one they call Toruk Makto?

01:35:06.429 --> 01:35:08.929
How many fish are in the sea?
1, 2.

01:35:08.953 --> 01:35:12.304
How many birds are in the sky?
1, 2, 3 -

01:35:13.728 --> 01:35:15.345
I mean, come on.
You couldn't have asked Eywa

01:35:15.369 --> 01:35:16.720
To make
me a little bit taller?

01:35:16.744 --> 01:35:18.179
Maybe even a little bit more blue?

01:35:18.203 --> 01:35:22.846
- No.. I was busy saving your life.
Skxawng

01:35:23.069 --> 01:35:25.379
- Just a little bit. A couple centimeters.

01:35:27.759 --> 01:35:29.999
She's the All Mother.
She can do anything.

01:35:32.559 --> 01:35:35.279
You are perfect just the way you are.

01:35:55.509 --> 01:35:56.629
Come on, monkey boy.

01:36:00.009 --> 01:36:02.489
So, next thing is I'm gonna learn
how to ride a skimwing.

01:36:03.209 --> 01:36:06.649
- So you can become a mighty warrior
and protect us all?

01:36:06.809 --> 01:36:08.679
Hey. It's not the size
of the dog in the fight.

01:36:08.703 --> 01:36:11.099
It's the size of fight in the dog.

01:36:11.472 --> 01:36:12.672
What is it?

01:36:19.539 --> 01:36:21.339
Run. Run!

01:36:30.739 --> 01:36:32.399
Go. Go!

01:36:33.700 --> 01:36:34.700
- Spider?

01:36:34.979 --> 01:36:39.149
- Over here, assholes!
Come on!

01:36:39.789 --> 01:36:42.989
Hey, skxawng!
This way, you bastards!

01:36:44.829 --> 01:36:48.269
Come on, dipshit!
Is that all you've got?

01:36:50.084 --> 01:36:51.084
Shit!

01:36:53.949 --> 01:36:57.345
Settle down there, cowboy.
Careful with that knife.

01:36:57.369 --> 01:36:58.589
That's how people get hurt.

01:37:00.637 --> 01:37:02.637
- Air breather.

01:37:17.159 --> 01:37:20.137
We fly.
- Break off.

01:37:20.161 --> 01:37:22.679
Dragonfly. Blue one,
you are cleared in.

01:37:38.366 --> 01:37:39.366
Tuk!

01:37:46.929 --> 01:37:48.512
They're blocking us in.
Weapons up.

01:37:48.536 --> 01:37:49.595
Weapons.

01:37:49.619 --> 01:37:51.554
- Where's your sister?
- She went for water.

01:37:51.578 --> 01:37:52.929
Where's Kiri?
Where's Spider?

01:37:56.019 --> 01:37:57.970
- Dad,
- Where's Spider?

01:37:57.994 --> 01:38:00.419
They took him.
The Blue Colonel took him.

01:38:13.619 --> 01:38:14.639
Take him.

01:38:35.549 --> 01:38:37.789
- Be calm.
- No fear.

01:38:39.229 --> 01:38:40.229
No fear.

01:38:48.039 --> 01:38:49.804
Jake Sully.

01:38:50.428 --> 01:38:52.199
Take the girls and you go now.

01:38:52.399 --> 01:38:55.519
- I will not go without you.
- No. They got Spider.

01:38:55.519 --> 01:38:58.120
There's nothing holding them back.
You've seen what they can do.

01:38:58.744 --> 01:39:03.239
- These people will die.
- You cannot ask this, husband.

01:39:03.239 --> 01:39:04.454
I can not.

01:39:05.878 --> 01:39:06.939
This is the only way.

01:39:08.333 --> 01:39:09.373
- Jake Sully!

01:39:10.009 --> 01:39:11.470
Show yourself.

01:39:11.494 --> 01:39:13.449
- You gotta go.
You gotta go right now.

01:39:13.729 --> 01:39:16.929
Take your sister, go and hide.
Go.

01:39:19.329 --> 01:39:22.345
If you stay, I stay.
I will kill many.

01:39:22.369 --> 01:39:26.369
Whatever happens, do not raise that bow.
You swear to me.

01:39:29.569 --> 01:39:32.262
I know he's here. Give him to me.

01:39:32.586 --> 01:39:33.969
He's Metkayina.

01:39:34.369 --> 01:39:37.369
He's one of us.
He's one of us!

01:39:38.409 --> 01:39:39.512
Burn something.

01:39:39.936 --> 01:39:43.387
- Dragon 2-4, lay down some incendiary
on the center village.

01:39:43.411 --> 01:39:44.969
- Copy. Switching incendiaries.

01:40:01.339 --> 01:40:05.839
- I want Jake Sully.
- Stop. Stop. No. No.

01:40:05.839 --> 01:40:08.059
Hold your fire.
Hold your fire. Stop.

01:40:09.519 --> 01:40:12.359
- Hold fire.
- Copy. Breaking off.

01:40:15.359 --> 01:40:17.159
This is my path, brother

01:40:25.035 --> 01:40:27.335
(Hissing)

01:40:35.209 --> 01:40:37.769
- Colonel.
- Corporal,

01:40:39.209 --> 01:40:41.929
Take me. You leave my family
and these people alone.

01:40:42.729 --> 01:40:46.169
Not good enough. Gonna need the missus too.

01:40:50.649 --> 01:40:51.970
- You get me.

01:40:51.994 --> 01:40:55.319
- Both of you or I hammer this place flat.

01:40:56.203 --> 01:40:58.099
Pregnant ladies, kids.

01:40:58.739 --> 01:41:01.595
I'll blow grandma's skinny shit
through the back of the hooch

01:41:01.619 --> 01:41:03.095
because I just don't care.

01:41:03.119 --> 01:41:06.099
And my pals here, well, they're just dying

01:41:06.199 --> 01:41:08.879
to waste everybody and take some scalps.

01:41:19.359 --> 01:41:21.359
(Collective hissing)

01:41:25.829 --> 01:41:28.629
Really? We doing this?

01:41:29.869 --> 01:41:33.549
When I drop my arm,
you and your new girlfriend die.

01:41:34.188 --> 01:41:38.189
- You in particular die a lot.
- I die, everybody here dies.

01:41:38.989 --> 01:41:42.829
Maybe. I think you can get some of us,
but not all of us.

01:41:43.149 --> 01:41:44.512
Maybe bum rush you.

01:41:44.536 --> 01:41:47.429
And your gunships hesitate
because we all look the same.

01:41:47.453 --> 01:41:50.129
And then when you're begging for your life,

01:41:52.609 --> 01:41:54.711
I'll scalp you.

01:41:54.935 --> 01:41:57.020
Well, damn, Corporal.

01:41:57.244 --> 01:42:00.845
I don't know if you're smart.
Or just shit nuts.

01:42:00.869 --> 01:42:03.089
You never struck me as all that smart.

01:42:04.129 --> 01:42:06.720
I need your word.
Marine to marine.

01:42:06.744 --> 01:42:10.179
Safety for these people.

01:42:10.603 --> 01:42:12.699
Burn them all,
Quaritch.

01:42:22.219 --> 01:42:23.712
- Do we have a deal?

01:42:28.513 --> 01:42:29.512
- Done.

01:42:29.536 --> 01:42:32.139
Want a pinky swear?

01:42:42.269 --> 01:42:43.349
- Take him.

01:42:44.795 --> 01:42:45.915
- Turn around.

01:42:51.909 --> 01:42:52.909
Move.

01:43:11.999 --> 01:43:14.062
Let's go. Come on.

01:43:14.086 --> 01:43:16.059
Another time then,
Mrs. Sully.

01:43:16.060 --> 01:43:17.060
(Hissing)

01:43:19.919 --> 01:43:21.359
- (Hissing)
- Saddle up.

01:44:04.859 --> 01:44:05.954
What do we got?

01:44:05.978 --> 01:44:07.512
- Ma'am, we have a big incursion.

01:44:07.536 --> 01:44:09.512
- Banshee riders inbound.
- I see that.

01:44:09.536 --> 01:44:12.059
- So light them up.
- I can't, Ma'am. Weapons locked out.

01:44:12.259 --> 01:44:13.920
They all have IFF badges.

01:44:15.044 --> 01:44:17.304
- Expand it
- Echo 1-6. And set the target

01:45:06.679 --> 01:45:08.599
All right. All right. Hold him there.

01:45:08.925 --> 01:45:09.925
- Easy! Easy!

01:45:10.849 --> 01:45:13.889
- Let's go.
- Jake!

01:45:13.969 --> 01:45:15.762
- Grab him.
Let's go. Move.

01:45:15.786 --> 01:45:17.129
- Jake!
- Bring him in.

01:45:17.629 --> 01:45:18.669
- Jake!

01:45:22.209 --> 01:45:23.269
Jake!

01:45:40.539 --> 01:45:45.579
Mission accomplished, General.
Jake Sully, Toruk Makto himself.

01:46:00.749 --> 01:46:02.687
It's not enough for you to hand out guns.

01:46:03.311 --> 01:46:07.829
You've got to bring hostiles
inside the perimeter.

01:46:08.549 --> 01:46:10.629
Not hostiles.
Allies.

01:46:11.709 --> 01:46:12.745
General Ardmore,

01:46:12.869 --> 01:46:16.309
I'd like you to meet Varang,
Tsahìk of the Mangkwan.

01:46:19.589 --> 01:46:21.887
Let me make this very
clear, Colonel Cochise.

01:46:21.911 --> 01:46:26.639
I want every one of these savages
escorted off my my base asap.

01:46:27.199 --> 01:46:29.199
Including your little missy over here.

01:46:35.759 --> 01:46:37.359
Don't be a jackass, General.

01:46:39.439 --> 01:46:40.439
Take the win.

01:46:42.799 --> 01:46:45.599
We got him, people. Huh?
- (Crowd cheering)

01:46:48.159 --> 01:46:49.199
End of an era.

01:47:07.567 --> 01:47:08.567
- Tsahìk

01:47:11.321 --> 01:47:12.321
- Let's go.

01:47:37.859 --> 01:47:41.059
Just feel this a little bit.. Hold still...

01:47:41.658 --> 01:47:43.338
- (Screaming in pain)

01:47:43.917 --> 01:47:45.197
- Almost there..

01:47:46.669 --> 01:47:48.349
- Good. Hold it there.

01:47:50.737 --> 01:47:51.737
- (Snarling)

01:47:53.677 --> 01:47:54.977
Payakan!

01:47:56.295 --> 01:47:57.895
(Ilu vocalizing)

01:47:58.204 --> 01:47:59.204
- Payakan!

01:48:06.029 --> 01:48:08.899
The people say the sea washes you clean.

01:48:09.354 --> 01:48:10.354
Payakan!

01:48:13.939 --> 01:48:15.120
- It's Lo'ak.
- It's him.

01:48:15.144 --> 01:48:16.299
- Lo'ak!
- It's him!

01:48:16.339 --> 01:48:18.272
- Lo'ak!
- Skxawng! Over here!

01:48:18.340 --> 01:48:19.260
-  Lo'ak!
- Lo'ak!

01:48:19.493 --> 01:48:20.493
- Tsireya!

01:48:24.419 --> 01:48:28.099
They also say if you see
the deep ones, the tsyong..

01:48:31.379 --> 01:48:33.219
They're spirits sent to judge you.

01:48:45.929 --> 01:48:46.729
- Tsyong!

01:48:46.860 --> 01:48:47.900
- Go, go, go!

01:50:03.098 --> 01:50:04.098
Lo'ak?

01:50:04.282 --> 01:50:05.282
Lo'ak? Lo'ak?

01:50:05.916 --> 01:50:06.916
Lo'ak!

01:50:11.449 --> 01:50:12.449
Tsireya

01:50:18.059 --> 01:50:21.499
- Thank you, Great Mother.
- Come on. Let him breathe.

01:50:21.499 --> 01:50:22.519
- Let him go.

01:50:26.779 --> 01:50:28.299
Can't believe you guys came after me.

01:50:29.659 --> 01:50:31.259
My friend's path is my path.

01:50:35.659 --> 01:50:37.345
Is this your sister?
- Yes.

01:50:38.169 --> 01:50:39.679
What about Payakan?

01:50:39.739 --> 01:50:42.709
- Does she hear him?
- He is close. He is coming now.

01:50:49.829 --> 01:50:53.149
- So what have you got?
- This mycelium

01:50:53.249 --> 01:50:54.454
that's living inside his body.

01:50:54.578 --> 01:50:56.162
- Wait. There's something
living inside of him?

01:50:56.186 --> 01:50:57.637
- Yes. It's an endosymbiont.

01:50:57.661 --> 01:50:59.429
Somehow
moderating the ion exchange.

01:50:59.453 --> 01:51:01.345
- Stop. I don't need to know how it works.

01:51:01.369 --> 01:51:03.129
I just need to know
if we can duplicate it

01:51:09.969 --> 01:51:11.489
Let me out of here, you jerk offs!

01:51:15.249 --> 01:51:18.449
- I told those rubber glove pukes
to lay off you for a while.

01:51:18.929 --> 01:51:23.389
- Where's Jake?
- He's locked up where he belongs. Here...

01:51:24.815 --> 01:51:26.448
I brought you a burger.

01:51:26.490 --> 01:51:27.065
(SMACK)

01:51:27.089 --> 01:51:29.969
- Better not hurt him.
- He's not part of your life anymore.

01:51:31.329 --> 01:51:34.939
You're with me now.
I'm your father.

01:51:35.419 --> 01:51:37.304
- My father's dead.

01:51:37.328 --> 01:51:41.054
You're just some.. made up thing they
gave his memories to.

01:51:41.078 --> 01:51:42.779
- No, no, no.

01:51:43.179 --> 01:51:46.779
I'm still me. I checked.
Yeah, look.

01:51:48.059 --> 01:51:51.339
- Colonel Miles Quaritch.
- Deceased.

01:51:56.779 --> 01:51:58.595
- You know, we didn't get
a chance to talk too much

01:51:58.619 --> 01:52:03.009
when we were out in the bush together,
But, uh.. I gotta thank you.

01:52:03.409 --> 01:52:06.949
I mean, you hauled me out of a sunken ship.

01:52:07.849 --> 01:52:09.179
You saved my life.

01:52:09.203 --> 01:52:12.245
- Yeah, sure wish I hadn't done that.

01:52:13.369 --> 01:52:14.889
- Maybe that's true.

01:52:16.248 --> 01:52:19.049
Maybe deep down, it isn't.
Either way,

01:52:20.249 --> 01:52:24.109
I owe you.
And I gotta tell you that, uh..

01:52:26.109 --> 01:52:28.699
Man, I'm proud of you.

01:52:30.099 --> 01:52:31.354
You're an amazing kid.

01:52:31.378 --> 01:52:36.220
You got guts, smarts, and,

01:52:36.244 --> 01:52:37.939
Son, you got the heart of a lion

01:52:39.986 --> 01:52:41.779
I see myself in you.

01:52:41.879 --> 01:52:44.720
Oh, yeah.

01:52:44.744 --> 01:52:47.595
I'll tell you who
I really see in you,

01:52:47.619 --> 01:52:48.739
and that's your mother.

01:52:50.899 --> 01:52:53.489
She was.. ferocious.

01:52:55.009 --> 01:52:58.889
Tough to live with, but.. I loved her.

01:52:59.389 --> 01:53:01.729
And, man, did she love you.

01:53:04.769 --> 01:53:06.729
Hardest thing she ever
did was climbing aboard

01:53:06.753 --> 01:53:07.848
that gunship that day,

01:53:08.209 --> 01:53:11.889
going into battle,
leaving her little baby behind.

01:53:15.009 --> 01:53:17.009
Your mom died a hero, son.

01:53:19.259 --> 01:53:20.619
You got that in you, too?

01:53:23.899 --> 01:53:26.912
Anyway, I didn't come down here
to take a trip down memory lane.

01:53:26.936 --> 01:53:28.970
I just came by to tell you
that I'm here for you.

01:53:30.294 --> 01:53:32.739
If.. you need me..

01:53:34.939 --> 01:53:38.519
I'm here for you.

01:53:40.139 --> 01:53:41.199
- Can I keep it?

01:53:52.229 --> 01:53:53.469
- Eat something. Will you?

01:54:04.869 --> 01:54:05.949
- Brother!

01:54:13.119 --> 01:54:14.559
I see you, brother.

01:54:20.879 --> 01:54:22.639
What is it?
What's wrong?

01:54:28.159 --> 01:54:29.919
Didn't you find your birth clan?

01:54:58.189 --> 01:55:00.054
Tulkun are already coming in,

01:55:00.078 --> 01:55:01.749
but the aggregation

01:55:01.849 --> 01:55:03.129
doesn't peak until the eclipse,

01:55:03.453 --> 01:55:05.189
which is the day after tomorrow.

01:55:05.669 --> 01:55:07.095
And that's when we hit them.

01:55:07.119 --> 01:55:08.789
- No, no, hold on.

01:55:09.109 --> 01:55:11.554
No. You're talking about
wholesale slaughter.

01:55:11.578 --> 01:55:14.387
Hundreds killed.
Entire pods just wiped out.

01:55:14.511 --> 01:55:17.887
- That's the beauty of the idea.
We'll fill a year's quota in just one day.

01:55:17.911 --> 01:55:20.389
- These are intelligent, soulful beings.

01:55:20.629 --> 01:55:23.749
- Who are you?
- Ian - Ian Garvin,

01:55:24.069 --> 01:55:27.639
Marine biologist.
These - These creatures,

01:55:28.139 --> 01:55:29.845
They have culture, they have music.

01:55:29.869 --> 01:55:31.959
They have names for each other.
This is organized.

01:55:32.059 --> 01:55:34.429
This aggregation is - is deliberate.

01:55:34.453 --> 01:55:35.679
It's a spiritual gathering.

01:55:35.679 --> 01:55:38.845
- Get off your high horse, Garvin.
We all made our deals.

01:55:38.869 --> 01:55:41.429
- No, I did not sign up for this!

01:55:41.453 --> 01:55:42.979
- Dr. Garvin. Dr. Garvin.
Thank you.

01:55:43.379 --> 01:55:44.662
Your protest has been noted.

01:55:44.886 --> 01:55:46.099
- Oh, it's been noted?
- Yes.

01:55:47.199 --> 01:55:48.929
- Sub teams and fast boats,

01:55:48.953 --> 01:55:51.029
you guys will form a cordon.

01:55:51.659 --> 01:55:53.387
You drive the family groups in here

01:55:53.411 --> 01:55:56.539
to where it forms a natural
choke point against the islands.

01:56:07.179 --> 01:56:08.539
I can't believe we got him.

01:56:10.219 --> 01:56:13.979
- Hey. Make a hole.
- Open up

01:56:15.659 --> 01:56:16.659
- Weapon, Sir.

01:56:25.909 --> 01:56:27.029
- End of the line, Jake.

01:56:28.789 --> 01:56:30.229
06:00.
Tomorrow.

01:56:33.029 --> 01:56:36.469
Varang wants your heart,
but I'm going old school.

01:56:37.029 --> 01:56:42.512
Firing squad.
Selfridge says it's a better optic.

01:56:42.536 --> 01:56:44.879
- Yeah. Will you be a good dog for the suits?

01:56:47.439 --> 01:56:48.639
- This isn't about them.

01:56:52.479 --> 01:56:55.179
This is about me and you.

01:56:55.203 --> 01:56:57.929
About a Marine that betrayed my trust.

01:56:57.953 --> 01:57:00.319
About the men and women I lost.

01:57:06.559 --> 01:57:09.137
- Dead man's memories,

01:57:10.961 --> 01:57:17.599
Miles Quaritch is gone.
You're free.

01:57:17.719 --> 01:57:19.720
And there is a world out there.

01:57:19.744 --> 01:57:23.079
There's things that those
suits will never understand.

01:57:25.135 --> 01:57:27.715
The Na'vi call it kame..

01:57:27.882 --> 01:57:28.882
To See

01:57:40.159 --> 01:57:41.599
And See this world.

01:57:44.999 --> 01:57:46.079
See yourself.

01:57:50.519 --> 01:57:54.119
- I'll see you. At 06:00

01:58:50.139 --> 01:58:51.512
Last time I got two.

01:58:51.536 --> 01:58:54.229
But they were the
ugliest ones in the village.

01:59:12.949 --> 01:59:16.069
- Open. Watch it.
- Hands on the wall.

01:59:16.759 --> 01:59:17.839
Hands on the wall.

01:59:22.199 --> 01:59:23.959
- All right, we're good. Close it.

01:59:36.199 --> 01:59:38.079
It's nothing. Just one of Quaritch's scouts.

02:00:08.839 --> 02:00:09.859
Watch for me.

02:00:31.819 --> 02:00:34.012
Okay. You've got a PHD.

02:00:34.036 --> 02:00:35.989
How hard can it be?

02:00:56.389 --> 02:00:57.469
Check this out.

02:01:01.839 --> 02:01:02.859
What's up, cutie?

02:01:02.905 --> 02:01:03.905
- (SNARLS)

02:01:05.999 --> 02:01:07.059
She wants me.

02:01:07.235 --> 02:01:08.435
- Naaaah
- What?

02:01:15.925 --> 02:01:17.605
- Quaritch.
- Quaritch.

02:01:20.879 --> 02:01:22.939
We are the fire. Mangkwan!

02:01:30.520 --> 02:01:32.520
- (Cheering)

02:01:33.112 --> 02:01:34.112
- (Hissing)

02:01:36.569 --> 02:01:40.489
Make no sound, witch.
Where is Jake Sully?

02:01:41.089 --> 02:01:43.969
- The wife, loyal to her man.

02:01:44.062 --> 02:01:45.422
- Speak or I cut.

02:01:49.729 --> 02:01:53.049
Where? I will not ask again.

02:01:54.195 --> 02:01:55.395
- (Hissing)

02:01:56.529 --> 02:01:59.969
No, wait, wait.
Past the camp.

02:02:01.609 --> 02:02:04.249
A cage for an animal..
- Take me there.

02:02:05.529 --> 02:02:07.849
- Move. Which way?
- Hey, sugar,

02:02:11.775 --> 02:02:12.305
- (Hissing)

02:02:12.329 --> 02:02:13.349
Join the party.

02:02:14.428 --> 02:02:15.428
- (HISSING)

02:02:26.099 --> 02:02:28.419
- Get after her.
- I want her heart!

02:02:42.829 --> 02:02:43.869
Go, Go, Go

02:03:00.110 --> 02:03:01.150
- Take cover!

02:03:02.309 --> 02:03:03.669
- Clear the area!

02:03:03.979 --> 02:03:05.679
- (Shouting)

02:03:14.662 --> 02:03:15.662
Jake!

02:03:18.489 --> 02:03:20.120
- General.
- Not now.

02:03:20.144 --> 02:03:22.189
- I have a situation.
- No, I have a situation.

02:03:22.689 --> 02:03:25.729
The kid is loose
and I need him back, alive.

02:03:35.459 --> 02:03:36.479
Light her up.

02:04:20.540 --> 02:04:21.540
- Hey!

02:04:21.863 --> 02:04:22.863
Woah!

02:04:22.979 --> 02:04:25.313
- Hey! Hey! Woah, hey!
- Stop! Stop!

02:04:28.436 --> 02:04:32.004
Out of the way, guys.
Move it, move it.

02:04:32.128 --> 02:04:33.489
Fire. Hit him, hit him, hit him.

02:04:35.909 --> 02:04:37.349
Out of the way, guys.

02:04:44.949 --> 02:04:45.949
Weigh it down...

02:04:48.864 --> 02:04:51.164
- (Shouting)

02:04:53.036 --> 02:04:54.119
Go. Jake,

02:04:57.999 --> 02:04:58.999
Light him up.

02:05:02.639 --> 02:05:03.759
Reverse..

02:05:07.439 --> 02:05:08.479
Got you.

02:05:11.326 --> 02:05:13.226
- (Shouting)

02:05:13.919 --> 02:05:15.029
- Aim for the cameras!

02:05:15.153 --> 02:05:16.853
Okay, stay with me..

02:05:24.889 --> 02:05:26.049
Stay with me.

02:05:31.529 --> 02:05:33.849
What am I doing?
What am I doing?

02:05:56.259 --> 02:05:58.019
Is my protest noted now, fuckers?

02:06:07.129 --> 02:06:10.089
Jake, this way.

02:06:10.349 --> 02:06:12.269
- No, no, this way. This way.
- Okay.

02:06:15.709 --> 02:06:17.309
Ian Garvin, Marine bio.

02:06:18.309 --> 02:06:19.320
- Come on.

02:06:19.344 --> 02:06:22.369
- Hey. I gotta say I'm a real big
fan of everything you've done.

02:06:22.669 --> 02:06:24.595
I'm more than a little
awe inspired right now.

02:06:24.619 --> 02:06:25.869
- The way that you..
- Shut up.

02:06:27.549 --> 02:06:31.229
- What's the plan?
- This is as far as I got.

02:06:31.949 --> 02:06:34.719
What, there's no plan.
Just Neytiri.

02:06:35.119 --> 02:06:36.159
Come on.

02:06:40.959 --> 02:06:42.139
Go, go, go.

02:06:54.879 --> 02:06:56.554
Why are you doing this?

02:06:57.078 --> 02:07:01.139
- There's going to be a massive
tulkun hunt the day after tomorrow.

02:07:02.099 --> 02:07:05.059
They're going to hit them
with every ship they've got.

02:07:05.059 --> 02:07:06.354
- Calf communion.

02:07:08.278 --> 02:07:10.104
- You've got to stop them.

02:07:10.128 --> 02:07:13.339
- You're the only one who can.
- Come on.

02:07:23.459 --> 02:07:25.079
Sa'ata, shhh...

02:07:28.699 --> 02:07:29.739
Let's go.

02:07:36.282 --> 02:07:37.282
Move, move!

02:07:38.739 --> 02:07:41.779
Go, now. Go, go!

02:07:47.979 --> 02:07:50.949
Damn it.
Go! Get out of here!

02:07:58.869 --> 02:08:01.470
Lima 1:6. There's a subject
pinned down behind a vehicle.

02:08:01.494 --> 02:08:02.649
Said Sully's pinned down.

02:08:02.849 --> 02:08:04.887
- Switch missiles, take him out.

02:08:04.911 --> 02:08:06.469
- Copy. Switching missiles.

02:08:08.069 --> 02:08:09.189
Hey. Remember me?

02:08:11.669 --> 02:08:14.629
That's right, pendejos!
Yeah! I don't need this shit.

02:08:16.399 --> 02:08:18.559
What are you gonna do?
You gonna shoot me?

02:08:20.879 --> 02:08:22.470
The kids with him?
The air breather.

02:08:22.494 --> 02:08:24.259
- He's blocking my shot.
- Move, move, move.

02:08:25.199 --> 02:08:26.799
Don't shoot. Tell him not to shoot.

02:08:27.999 --> 02:08:30.429
Lima 1-6. Blue 1. Hold your fire.

02:08:30.453 --> 02:08:31.970
Keep visual on him.

02:08:31.994 --> 02:08:34.845
1-6, hold your fire. Get more assets in
that position.

02:08:34.869 --> 02:08:36.970
Yeah. You're not gonna shoot me. You know
why?

02:08:36.994 --> 02:08:40.159
Because you can't. Know what you can do though?

02:08:40.399 --> 02:08:43.569
You can kiss my ass. Yeah!
Come on, Jake. Go.

02:08:44.069 --> 02:08:47.209
What are you doing?
Come on. Go, go. Come on.

02:08:48.729 --> 02:08:49.612
- He's moving west.

02:08:49.636 --> 02:08:52.269
Maintain a target lock.
The shot is not clear.

02:08:53.529 --> 02:08:54.649
- Hey, stay on me.

02:09:00.969 --> 02:09:02.137
Stay close to me.

02:09:02.161 --> 02:09:03.809
I'm not gonna play this game.

02:09:04.109 --> 02:09:05.387
Lima 1-6, take your shot.

02:09:05.411 --> 02:09:07.054
- No, no, don't shoot.

02:09:07.078 --> 02:09:08.079
- Get him out of here.

02:09:08.159 --> 02:09:09.595
Hold your fire.

02:09:09.919 --> 02:09:11.219
Go, go, go!

02:09:11.299 --> 02:09:14.599
Lima 1-6, you are cleared hot.
Weapons free.

02:09:14.599 --> 02:09:16.499
Unable. I lost visual.
Coming around.

02:09:18.739 --> 02:09:20.254
- He's coming back around.
- This way!

02:09:20.278 --> 02:09:22.939
This is Blue 1, check your fire.

02:09:23.239 --> 02:09:25.179
- Lima 1-6, you are cleared hot.

02:09:25.203 --> 02:09:26.979
- 1-6 in hot.

02:09:33.584 --> 02:09:34.584
- Down!

02:09:43.985 --> 02:09:44.985
- Ma Jake!

02:09:46.039 --> 02:09:48.304
- Neytiri!

02:09:48.328 --> 02:09:52.337
- Baby. I don't know whether
to kiss you or yell at you.

02:09:52.361 --> 02:09:53.519
- You waste time.

02:09:54.199 --> 02:09:55.379
Come on, let's go.

02:09:57.779 --> 02:09:58.779
- Let's go

02:10:14.769 --> 02:10:15.969
Land, anywhere.

02:10:38.779 --> 02:10:40.762
I gotta take a huge leak.

02:10:41.586 --> 02:10:44.045
You guys landed just in time.

02:10:44.969 --> 02:10:46.059
- What is it?

02:10:46.459 --> 02:10:47.579
Why are we stopping?

02:10:53.269 --> 02:10:56.389
They didn't even put a fly in this thing.
That's just dumb.

02:10:57.669 --> 02:11:00.595
Good idea. Drink first,
then piss in the stream.

02:11:00.619 --> 02:11:04.229
- What is it Jake?
- I was wrong.

02:11:05.429 --> 02:11:06.869
We can't protect him.

02:11:08.469 --> 02:11:11.109
I gotta take this stuff off.. It's itchy as Hell.

02:11:12.149 --> 02:11:15.129
Quaritch has this woman..
He can find us wherever we go..

02:11:17.453 --> 02:11:18.679
They will get him.

02:11:18.703 --> 02:11:20.579
They will study him.

02:11:21.219 --> 02:11:23.379
And when humans can breathe our air,

02:11:25.459 --> 02:11:28.220
then they will spread across this world

02:11:28.244 --> 02:11:31.429
and they will destroy the
forests, the oceans, everything.

02:11:31.453 --> 02:11:32.739
Just like on Earth.

02:11:33.779 --> 02:11:36.419
Then the Na'vi people will be gone.

02:11:37.539 --> 02:11:39.219
The tulkun will be gone.

02:11:40.669 --> 02:11:43.469
And I can't let that happen.

02:11:44.109 --> 02:11:45.709
- Are you hungry? I'm starving.

02:11:52.429 --> 02:11:53.509
You were right.

02:11:58.829 --> 02:11:59.949
This has to be done.

02:12:02.269 --> 02:12:03.679
- Jake...

02:12:05.237 --> 02:12:07.037
He saved your life..

02:12:18.759 --> 02:12:20.119
This is the only way.

02:12:33.009 --> 02:12:36.529
Spider. Come here.

02:12:44.209 --> 02:12:45.209
- What's going on?

02:12:48.449 --> 02:12:51.409
What is it?
- Just come with me.

02:12:54.369 --> 02:12:55.429
Come on, let's go.

02:13:05.079 --> 02:13:06.620
Hey, stop for a second.
I gotta take a leak.

02:13:06.744 --> 02:13:08.139
- Just stay close.

02:13:17.339 --> 02:13:19.899
- Where are we going?
- Be quiet.

02:13:35.909 --> 02:13:37.669
So is this like, a talk?

02:13:50.719 --> 02:13:52.559
Come here. Come on. Come on.

02:13:56.719 --> 02:13:59.919
This will work.
Kneel.

02:14:01.119 --> 02:14:02.762
Kneel.
- No.

02:14:02.786 --> 02:14:03.839
- Kneel down.

02:14:04.959 --> 02:14:07.999
- Please. Jake. Please, stop.

02:14:08.959 --> 02:14:10.959
- Eyes front. Don't move.

02:14:11.599 --> 02:14:14.079
- Please, you don't have to do this.

02:14:16.399 --> 02:14:17.404
Please.

02:14:18.028 --> 02:14:20.299
- Great Mother, are you here?

02:14:21.839 --> 02:14:23.137
- You don't have to do this.

02:14:23.161 --> 02:14:25.799
- Guide my hand.
- Please don't do this.

02:14:26.299 --> 02:14:29.478
- Give me strength.
- Just stop. Please. Stop.

02:14:29.978 --> 02:14:30.987
Please.

02:14:31.311 --> 02:14:35.819
- Don't look at me. Don't look at me.
- Please!

02:14:36.760 --> 02:14:38.040
Forgive me, son.

02:14:38.219 --> 02:14:41.220
- I'll be good.
- May your spirit go to Eywa.

02:14:41.244 --> 02:14:43.929
- I promise.
- May your body return to the forest.

02:14:46.009 --> 02:14:48.169
- Please, Dad.
- To preserve the great balance.

02:14:49.209 --> 02:14:51.049
May the ancestors welcome you.

02:14:51.493 --> 02:14:54.993
- (Sobbing)

02:15:05.139 --> 02:15:06.979
- Please.

02:15:08.179 --> 02:15:10.054
- May the ancestors hold you.

02:15:10.078 --> 02:15:11.929
May they sing your song.

02:15:11.953 --> 02:15:15.299
- I know I have to go to Eywa now.

02:15:17.219 --> 02:15:19.470
It's okay.

02:15:19.494 --> 02:15:20.519
But..

02:15:21.348 --> 02:15:22.348
Do you..

02:15:23.512 --> 02:15:25.192
Do you still love me?

02:15:27.139 --> 02:15:28.179
With all my heart.

02:16:12.389 --> 02:16:13.389
- Ma Jake?

02:16:13.926 --> 02:16:15.126
Ma Jake!

02:16:25.629 --> 02:16:26.629
I See you.

02:16:35.089 --> 02:16:37.568
- Whatever happens, it won't be .. this way.

02:16:39.809 --> 02:16:41.649
- Then we will find another way.

02:16:58.298 --> 02:17:03.138
My dad knew in his heart
there was only ever one path

02:17:10.618 --> 02:17:14.128
No matter how you imagine
yourself. As a father,

02:17:14.928 --> 02:17:17.808
As a husband. Sooner or later,

02:17:18.688 --> 02:17:19.728
you're back on it.

02:17:39.699 --> 02:17:40.779
- Hello, old friend.

02:17:43.659 --> 02:17:45.419
Toruk loved my father.

02:17:48.459 --> 02:17:50.059
He knew they were greater together.

02:17:51.339 --> 02:17:54.139
That when they flew,
there would be blood.

02:17:58.139 --> 02:17:59.219
- He is coming.

02:18:23.764 --> 02:18:25.364
- Toruk Makto!

02:18:28.058 --> 02:18:29.015
- No, no, no..

02:18:29.039 --> 02:18:31.359
Just, please.. Stand.

02:18:32.079 --> 02:18:33.599
Stand up. Please,

02:18:34.799 --> 02:18:35.887
Baby.
- Jake.

02:18:36.211 --> 02:18:39.439
Please. It's okay.
It's okay.

02:18:42.159 --> 02:18:45.639
Go now to all the clans
within the day's ride and tell them

02:18:49.119 --> 02:18:51.319
Tell them Toruk Makto calls to them.

02:18:53.679 --> 02:18:57.229
You tell them.. The day has come.

02:19:38.079 --> 02:19:41.839
And so it came to pass
that Toruk Makto returned.

02:19:42.479 --> 02:19:45.039
My father united the clans once again.

02:19:46.448 --> 02:19:48.070
He made the great speeches.

02:19:48.494 --> 02:19:52.054
Many arrows together, cannot be broken.

02:19:54.278 --> 02:19:55.808
We cannot be broken!

02:19:55.878 --> 02:20:00.478
(Cheering)

02:20:03.729 --> 02:20:05.969
But he knew that it wasn't enough.

02:20:24.540 --> 02:20:27.340
Great Matriarch, wise elders,

02:20:29.100 --> 02:20:32.380
the Sky People are coming. Here today,

02:20:33.180 --> 02:20:36.260
Right now, to kill our Tulkun families.

02:20:37.610 --> 02:20:40.570
I beg you, Fight with us.

02:20:49.290 --> 02:20:52.489
- She says we respect Toruk Makto,

02:20:52.970 --> 02:20:54.570
but our ways are ancient.

02:20:59.130 --> 02:21:02.790
We believe that killing
will only bring more killing

02:21:03.510 --> 02:21:06.230
in an endless, expanding spiral.

02:21:08.870 --> 02:21:11.638
- Hear my words.

02:21:11.662 --> 02:21:14.846
The Sky People will never stop.

02:21:14.870 --> 02:21:18.154
Not until the last of the tulkun is hunted.

02:21:24.750 --> 02:21:26.050
- Lo'ak!

02:21:39.470 --> 02:21:41.846
- Stop. Stop.
- Lo'ak, what are you doing?

02:21:41.870 --> 02:21:44.305
Alright, you can't be here.
- Dad, wait.

02:21:44.329 --> 02:21:46.270
I am brother of Tulkun.

02:21:46.750 --> 02:21:49.950
- I have a right to speak.
- Lo'ak speaks the truth.

02:21:50.030 --> 02:21:52.270
- You must listen.
- Tsireya

02:21:57.420 --> 02:22:02.700
She says his brother is outcast.
You have no standing here.

02:22:05.020 --> 02:22:08.780
- If he is outcast, then I am outcast.

02:22:09.980 --> 02:22:13.060
- And I am outcast.
- Daughter, silence!

02:22:13.160 --> 02:22:16.540
No! You will never see me again.

02:22:18.860 --> 02:22:22.020
- And I and my brother are outcast.
- Aonung!

02:22:22.520 --> 02:22:26.070
- And we are also outcast.

02:22:38.390 --> 02:22:41.190
- She says.. You may speak.

02:22:45.350 --> 02:22:50.221
- Hear my words. My brother returned
to his birth clan to defend them.

02:22:50.745 --> 02:22:54.471
But his clan was wiped out
by the demon ships.

02:22:54.495 --> 02:22:58.888
Only Ta'nok survived.. Because
she fought back!

02:22:58.912 --> 02:23:00.710
Come forward.

02:23:28.275 --> 02:23:29.975
Ta'nok says..

02:23:30.000 --> 02:23:35.120
I speak for the dead mothers
and the dead calves.

02:23:40.730 --> 02:23:42.055
I speak for my people.

02:23:42.079 --> 02:23:44.050
And all our songs..

02:23:46.254 --> 02:23:47.254
Gone...

02:23:48.541 --> 02:23:49.541
Forever.

02:23:55.210 --> 02:23:59.290
She says I am the last.
The blind witness to our end.

02:24:05.700 --> 02:24:08.260
Ta'nok says the Tulkun way must change.

02:24:09.060 --> 02:24:10.740
Payakan shows our path.

02:24:18.740 --> 02:24:20.920
We must fight.

02:24:20.952 --> 02:24:22.632
- We must fight!

02:24:40.110 --> 02:24:42.990
- What did she say?
- They will decide.

02:24:44.990 --> 02:24:48.630
Look at all of this.
I mean, there's hundreds of them.

02:24:49.630 --> 02:24:53.170
And look at all these old ones.
And old is good.

02:24:53.790 --> 02:24:57.680
They never stop growing.
Which means more Amrita

02:24:58.480 --> 02:25:03.096
And look at this mama.
She must be 100 meters.

02:25:03.420 --> 02:25:05.620
- You're briefing without me.

02:25:06.280 --> 02:25:08.055
An oversight, I assume.

02:25:08.279 --> 02:25:10.138
- No, this is not an oversight.

02:25:10.162 --> 02:25:13.471
After your fiasco with Sully.
You're done, Colonel.

02:25:13.495 --> 02:25:16.520
You're confined to base
pending an investigation.

02:25:17.080 --> 02:25:19.138
- Negative on that.
I need to roll.

02:25:19.162 --> 02:25:22.430
Sully will be there, which means
that Spider will be there as well.

02:25:22.454 --> 02:25:25.096
- Don't look at him.
He's one step away from the brig himself.

02:25:25.120 --> 02:25:26.596
- Don't tell him not to look at me.

02:25:26.620 --> 02:25:28.221
- What are you gonna do, call Daddy?

02:25:28.245 --> 02:25:30.180
- You mean the chairman?
- That's enough.

02:25:32.260 --> 02:25:34.580
- I can still complete this mission.

02:25:35.060 --> 02:25:38.260
- Look at you.
You're a disgrace to your uniform.

02:25:38.500 --> 02:25:40.660
Assuming you remember what a uniform is.

02:25:42.020 --> 02:25:44.420
You're grounded, Colonel, permanently.

02:26:01.630 --> 02:26:02.670
Why are you here, girl?

02:26:05.230 --> 02:26:06.510
- To pray, Tsahìk.

02:26:11.630 --> 02:26:12.670
- No, child.

02:26:16.600 --> 02:26:18.200
Why did you come to us?

02:26:21.720 --> 02:26:27.080
Perhaps it was for this moment

02:26:27.104 --> 02:26:31.520
only a chosen one may
call upon the Warrior Mother..

02:26:34.860 --> 02:26:36.927
- (Groaning in pain)
- Tsahìk..?

02:26:38.040 --> 02:26:41.200
- You're having contractions.
- I fear we will..

02:26:41.920 --> 02:26:43.440
We will not survive this.

02:26:48.640 --> 02:26:51.305
Kiri,

02:26:52.429 --> 02:26:54.205
hear my words.

02:26:54.829 --> 02:26:57.860
If there is something you can do..

02:26:59.260 --> 02:27:01.800
Then you must do it

02:27:05.200 --> 02:27:07.450
- You have a strong heart.

02:27:08.730 --> 02:27:09.730
- Here.

02:27:10.680 --> 02:27:12.360
- I'm riding with you?

02:27:12.410 --> 02:27:13.610
- No. I need you here.

02:27:16.090 --> 02:27:18.680
I can't do this unless I know
you kids are safe.

02:27:18.704 --> 02:27:20.680
You keep your post no matter what happens.

02:27:21.204 --> 02:27:22.810
You read me?

02:27:22.885 --> 02:27:24.485
- Lima Charlie, Sir.

02:27:30.970 --> 02:27:32.763
- If your father and I do not return,

02:27:32.787 --> 02:27:38.530
you take Spider and the girls and
you go as far and as fast as you can.

02:28:25.920 --> 02:28:26.920
Holy shit.

02:28:31.940 --> 02:28:34.471
General, this Flux is off the scale.

02:28:34.495 --> 02:28:36.846
- Keep a wide radius from that Flux Devil.

02:28:37.070 --> 02:28:38.600
That thing will rip your face off.

02:28:39.300 --> 02:28:40.900
- Roger. Gun runner coming right.

02:28:58.110 --> 02:29:00.670
Okay, boys, let's make some bank!

02:29:02.350 --> 02:29:04.110
Let's go. Let's do this.

02:29:15.280 --> 02:29:16.960
Sub team, get wet.

02:29:27.160 --> 02:29:29.480
Yeah, baby! (Laughs)
Let's do this!

02:29:39.400 --> 02:29:42.370
- See any hostiles?
- Negative. No movement.

02:29:42.850 --> 02:29:44.770
And the big guys
are just doing their thing.

02:29:47.730 --> 02:29:49.490
Fish in a barrel, Scoresby.

02:29:50.214 --> 02:29:51.414
- Hold

02:29:54.770 --> 02:29:57.250
Just hold. Hold, hold...

02:29:59.374 --> 02:30:00.374
- Hold...

02:30:10.540 --> 02:30:11.900
Hang on...

02:30:12.529 --> 02:30:13.969
There's no bulls..

02:30:14.719 --> 02:30:16.076
And no big females.

02:30:17.000 --> 02:30:18.180
- There's no elders.

02:30:21.020 --> 02:30:23.071
- Hold up, everybody.

02:30:23.295 --> 02:30:27.300
- Sir, I got a big signature.
Tulkun. Big ones.

02:30:28.300 --> 02:30:31.020
Lots of big ones.
- Multiple tulkun inbound.

02:30:43.990 --> 02:30:46.318
Scoresby, I thought you
told me they're not aggressive.

02:30:46.342 --> 02:30:48.910
- Well, they're not..

02:30:48.989 --> 02:30:49.989
Generally...

02:31:00.592 --> 02:31:02.040
- I've lost visual

02:31:31.960 --> 02:31:34.680
Dude, they're fighting! Yes! Yes!

02:31:50.604 --> 02:31:53.837
(Shouting)
(Alarms blaring)

02:31:57.841 --> 02:31:59.141
(Cheering)

02:31:59.378 --> 02:32:00.078
- NOW!

02:32:00.172 --> 02:32:01.172
- KÄ!

02:32:02.656 --> 02:32:03.856
- MAKTO KO!

02:32:05.864 --> 02:32:06.864
- Yeah!

02:32:14.975 --> 02:32:17.775
(War cries)

02:32:22.808 --> 02:32:23.808
(Yelling)

02:32:29.901 --> 02:32:30.901
- Watch it!

02:32:53.270 --> 02:32:55.910
Man your weapons. Open fire.

02:33:21.266 --> 02:33:22.946
Port side! Port side!

02:33:23.630 --> 02:33:24.630
(Yelling)

02:33:27.800 --> 02:33:28.410
Reload!

02:33:29.029 --> 02:33:30.029
- Watch out!

02:33:54.695 --> 02:33:56.215
(Muffled screaming)

02:34:03.100 --> 02:34:04.520
Yeah, Jake!

02:34:04.637 --> 02:34:05.637
- Bro, look!

02:34:17.451 --> 02:34:18.451
- Nice!

02:34:19.091 --> 02:34:19.491
Yeah!

02:34:34.182 --> 02:34:34.682
Jake!

02:34:39.152 --> 02:34:40.352
It's the Ash...

02:34:41.530 --> 02:34:45.410
Bogey's inbound. Banshee Riders.
Over a hundred. They're friendlies.

02:34:45.410 --> 02:34:46.963
They have IFF badges.

02:34:47.282 --> 02:34:48.263
- They're ours.

02:34:48.287 --> 02:34:50.471
- Thanks for getting Sully
out in the open, General.

02:34:50.495 --> 02:34:51.780
I'll take it from here.

02:34:52.740 --> 02:34:53.740
(War cry)

02:35:28.800 --> 02:35:30.080
They can't win.

02:35:31.166 --> 02:35:32.286
They're dying!

02:35:34.420 --> 02:35:37.140
- Woah- Kiri!
- Kiri!

02:35:37.339 --> 02:35:38.339
- Stop her!
- Kiri!

02:35:38.856 --> 02:35:39.856
Kiri, stop!

02:35:40.283 --> 02:35:41.283
Kiri, no- Stop stop stop!

02:35:41.570 --> 02:35:42.763
Get back to the shelter right now.

02:35:42.787 --> 02:35:43.796
It's not safe out here.

02:35:43.820 --> 02:35:45.388
I have to call to the Great Mother.

02:35:45.412 --> 02:35:46.846
If you connect underwater,
it'll kill you.

02:35:46.870 --> 02:35:49.138
- You can't do this. We have to go.

02:35:49.162 --> 02:35:51.570
- You can't be out here right now.
Go. Get back.

02:35:51.810 --> 02:35:53.050
Kiri wait, Kiri stop.

02:35:55.090 --> 02:35:56.790
- Kiri stop!
- Kiri!

02:35:57.199 --> 02:35:57.999
Kiri!

02:35:58.020 --> 02:35:59.020
- Kiri!

02:35:59.970 --> 02:36:03.010
- Come on!
- No, wait - Crap. Crap.

02:36:03.970 --> 02:36:05.590
Tuk. You stay back. I mean it.

02:36:05.662 --> 02:36:06.942
- Lo'ak, come on.

02:36:08.410 --> 02:36:10.090
- Do not follow me.
- Come on!

02:36:40.040 --> 02:36:41.800
- Lo'ak, they're coming.
- Fight with us.

02:36:45.620 --> 02:36:48.500
- Go. I'll stay with her.
- Come on.

02:37:02.390 --> 02:37:04.950
Oh, Mother, hear my words.

02:37:06.670 --> 02:37:08.570
Please help us.

02:37:09.308 --> 02:37:10.308
I beg you..

02:37:10.970 --> 02:37:12.990
You are our only hope.

02:37:26.740 --> 02:37:28.980
Please! We need you.

02:37:31.060 --> 02:37:32.520
Don't push me away.

02:37:37.540 --> 02:37:40.260
Please don't. No, please.

02:37:48.835 --> 02:37:49.835
No, no!

02:37:50.770 --> 02:37:54.130
No.
Monkey boy..?

02:37:54.450 --> 02:37:57.010
- Let's do this. Come on!

02:37:59.890 --> 02:38:00.950
Come on.

02:38:02.332 --> 02:38:03.332
- Fire!

02:38:18.990 --> 02:38:21.010
I beg you. Please.

02:38:25.250 --> 02:38:28.450
No, please! The people are dying.

02:38:37.090 --> 02:38:38.730
Please. No!

02:38:41.170 --> 02:38:42.070
Tuk..

02:38:42.071 --> 02:38:43.071
- Come on

02:38:43.367 --> 02:38:44.367
Come on!

02:38:45.120 --> 02:38:46.200
We can do this.

02:38:49.300 --> 02:38:50.580
Sullys never quit!

02:39:08.390 --> 02:39:10.030
- Come on, let's go

02:39:10.218 --> 02:39:11.958
- Tuk...
- Come on!

02:39:31.000 --> 02:39:34.040
Great Mother, help us.
We beg you.

02:39:35.360 --> 02:39:36.880
The people are dying!

02:39:39.440 --> 02:39:41.346
I call upon the Warrior Mother.

02:39:41.370 --> 02:39:43.280
You are our only hope.

02:40:43.980 --> 02:40:45.120
Fire.

02:40:55.395 --> 02:40:56.755
(Muffled) Nooooo!

02:41:00.250 --> 02:41:01.690
That's him.
Get after him.

02:41:07.350 --> 02:41:08.620
Flank aft, box him in.

02:41:17.771 --> 02:41:19.691
(Screaming in pain)

02:41:39.474 --> 02:41:40.474
Sa'ata!

02:41:41.090 --> 02:41:43.170
Good girl. Good girl.

02:41:59.410 --> 02:42:01.013
- You okay?
- Yes.

02:42:02.237 --> 02:42:04.530
- Where's Kiri?

02:42:09.120 --> 02:42:10.340
Jake, I'm down.

02:42:11.717 --> 02:42:12.717
Get to safety.

02:42:13.500 --> 02:42:14.560
- Do not attack.

02:42:17.340 --> 02:42:18.360
We're done.

02:42:37.574 --> 02:42:38.574
- Dad!

02:42:39.934 --> 02:42:41.134
- Lo'ak..
- Dad!

02:42:42.550 --> 02:42:44.030
It's okay. It's okay. I got you.

02:42:45.656 --> 02:42:47.556
(Pained sounds)

02:42:51.674 --> 02:42:52.674
- Tsahìk?

02:43:05.720 --> 02:43:07.188
Stay here. I'm going back for her.

02:43:07.312 --> 02:43:08.940
- You can't leave me by myself.

02:43:19.040 --> 02:43:20.080
Sa'ata, wait.

02:43:25.330 --> 02:43:27.650
- I am dying.
- No, you're not.

02:43:29.290 --> 02:43:32.650
- Why must you always argue? I am..

02:43:33.130 --> 02:43:36.890
I am dying.
But first, I will push out this baby.

02:43:37.715 --> 02:43:38.715
(Groaning)

02:43:46.040 --> 02:43:47.380
Then push!

02:43:49.860 --> 02:43:50.980
I got you. I got you.

02:43:56.980 --> 02:44:00.660
- I'm gonna pull it on three.
- No, don't. Don't. just don't.

02:44:00.740 --> 02:44:02.020
I gotta pack the wound.

02:44:15.950 --> 02:44:19.230
Kiri, Kiri, Kiri.

02:44:28.030 --> 02:44:29.110
Are you okay?

02:44:31.630 --> 02:44:32.630
Good.

02:44:34.226 --> 02:44:35.266
Push, Tsahìk!

02:44:36.812 --> 02:44:38.332
(Screaming in pain)

02:44:40.260 --> 02:44:41.620
You have one more push.

02:44:42.543 --> 02:44:43.543
(Screaming)

02:44:43.700 --> 02:44:46.420
- She's coming. She's coming.

02:44:50.400 --> 02:44:51.400
Take your child.

02:44:58.080 --> 02:44:59.120
Thank you...

02:45:00.904 --> 02:45:01.904
Neytiri..

02:45:02.830 --> 02:45:03.870
Thank you.

02:45:05.511 --> 02:45:06.791
(Pained sounds)

02:45:08.030 --> 02:45:09.070
What is her name?

02:45:10.732 --> 02:45:11.732
She...

02:45:12.190 --> 02:45:13.390
She is Pril.

02:45:16.510 --> 02:45:17.550
Be strong.

02:45:22.970 --> 02:45:24.930
Pril is a good name.

02:45:26.254 --> 02:45:27.840
- You will protect her?

02:45:29.853 --> 02:45:30.853
Yes.

02:45:38.360 --> 02:45:46.400
(Pril crying)

02:45:54.330 --> 02:45:56.146
Dad. I'm - I'm sorry I left my post.

02:45:56.170 --> 02:45:58.771
- It's okay, son.
- No-

02:45:58.795 --> 02:46:00.730
- You've proven yourself to me.

02:46:02.330 --> 02:46:05.070
I mean, getting the tulkun to fight.

02:46:06.410 --> 02:46:08.380
Toruk Makto couldn't do it.

02:46:08.404 --> 02:46:13.050
Hey, you did it.
I'm proud of you.

02:46:38.268 --> 02:46:39.308
(Tuk screams)

02:46:41.620 --> 02:46:43.730
22. What's your status? Casualties?

02:46:44.754 --> 02:46:46.563
- All right, people,

02:46:47.087 --> 02:46:48.580
Let's get ourselves together.

02:46:48.604 --> 02:46:50.310
We've still got work to do.

02:46:51.282 --> 02:46:52.282
Seriously?!

02:46:54.330 --> 02:46:56.905
There's a hundred billion
dollars waiting in that cove

02:46:56.929 --> 02:46:59.372
and nothing standing in our way.

02:47:00.995 --> 02:47:02.270
Beers are on me.

02:47:04.610 --> 02:47:06.770
Your name is Pril.

02:47:08.190 --> 02:47:11.063
Your mother was powerful.
You will be powerful too.

02:47:11.087 --> 02:47:12.200
- Mrs. Sully!
(Gasps)

02:47:31.800 --> 02:47:33.540
Spoils of war.

02:47:34.267 --> 02:47:35.267
Dad!

02:47:35.310 --> 02:47:36.450
Dad look,

02:47:48.330 --> 02:47:52.130
I need you now, by my side.

02:47:52.630 --> 02:47:54.850
I need my wingman.

02:47:55.450 --> 02:47:56.970
- Okay.
- Let's move out.

02:48:04.546 --> 02:48:05.746
(Pained sounds)

02:48:10.252 --> 02:48:11.252
Jake?

02:48:11.620 --> 02:48:14.260
I know you're out there.
I know you can hear me.

02:48:15.380 --> 02:48:17.780
Varang here is lighting up
your wife pretty good.

02:48:18.603 --> 02:48:19.963
(Neytiri screams)

02:48:24.162 --> 02:48:25.162
- Nooo!

02:48:27.230 --> 02:48:30.590
Now, I want you to come in
and I want you to bring Spider with you,

02:48:31.090 --> 02:48:33.070
and I know you copy that.

02:48:34.430 --> 02:48:35.510
Thanks, baby.

02:48:35.676 --> 02:48:37.176
(Neytiri panting)
(Pril crying)

02:48:41.150 --> 02:48:43.470
Picadors, get in there! Go go!

02:48:43.908 --> 02:48:44.908
Go!

02:48:58.890 --> 02:49:00.046
They're trapping them.

02:49:00.170 --> 02:49:02.390
Let's get those heifers herded in tight.

02:49:18.940 --> 02:49:21.980
100 meters. Get me in there.
Get me in range.

02:49:24.845 --> 02:49:25.845
Shit!

02:49:28.700 --> 02:49:31.420
Matadors, ahead slow.
Even spacing.

02:49:33.500 --> 02:49:35.820
Sub teams.
Torpedoes ready.

02:49:36.380 --> 02:49:39.340
- Arm torpedoes.
- Arming one-through-four. Torpedoes armed.

02:49:39.500 --> 02:49:42.060
60 meters. Target lock.

02:49:49.330 --> 02:49:50.510
Safety's off.

02:49:53.890 --> 02:49:55.170
Stand by to fire.

02:50:06.530 --> 02:50:07.550
Look, look.

02:50:22.880 --> 02:50:23.540
- Hold your fire!

02:50:23.575 --> 02:50:25.095
Hold fire for what?

02:50:25.379 --> 02:50:29.200
- We've got a situation down here..
- It's Eywa. It worked.

02:50:30.240 --> 02:50:31.320
It worked!

02:50:52.650 --> 02:50:55.290
- Look out!
- Get us out of here!

02:50:56.098 --> 02:50:57.098
(Screaming)

02:51:16.900 --> 02:51:20.180
Go, go, go. Hit it!
All boats back to the ship.

02:51:20.380 --> 02:51:22.040
All boats back to the ship!

02:51:24.578 --> 02:51:25.578
Yeah!

02:51:25.710 --> 02:51:26.910
That's right, buttholes.

02:52:24.880 --> 02:52:27.400
- Get us out of here.
- Can't. Propulsion's down.

02:53:04.839 --> 02:53:06.739
(Screaming)

02:53:26.448 --> 02:53:28.015
- I need power. Get me back up!

02:53:30.090 --> 02:53:33.050
- General, Flex Devil's pulling us in.

02:53:35.700 --> 02:53:38.900
- Abandon ship.
- Abandon ship!

02:53:45.300 --> 02:53:46.340
Stay close.

02:53:57.220 --> 02:53:58.260
Stay close.

02:54:00.910 --> 02:54:03.230
- Clear.
- Clear.

02:54:09.462 --> 02:54:10.462
Tuck in!

02:54:10.870 --> 02:54:12.390
- Get to the lifeboat.
Get off the ship!

02:54:12.958 --> 02:54:13.558
- Run!

02:54:15.610 --> 02:54:17.344
Death, Fire, Death, Death!

02:54:17.671 --> 02:54:18.406
Death, Fire, Fire, Death!

02:54:18.430 --> 02:54:20.510
Death, Fire, Fire, Death!
Okay, I'll need covering fire.

02:54:21.390 --> 02:54:23.813
Okay, I'm gonna push left

02:54:23.837 --> 02:54:25.938
down the port side
and get around behind them.

02:54:25.962 --> 02:54:28.105
- Get eyes on me. Just watch me.
- Yes, sir.

02:54:28.129 --> 02:54:30.960
- And.. don't shoot anyone you love.

02:54:31.210 --> 02:54:32.210
Go, go!

02:54:44.720 --> 02:54:47.938
Colonel, this is Spider. I'm here.

02:54:47.962 --> 02:54:49.280
Don't kill them.

02:54:52.004 --> 02:54:54.570
Where are you, boy?
Step out now.

02:54:56.890 --> 02:54:58.650
All right. I'll come out.

02:55:00.031 --> 02:55:04.131
(Varang trilling and chanting)

02:55:11.370 --> 02:55:15.130
Spider, you hear me?
We're running out of time.

